  <book code="MRK" style="id">EN_DADT mji-x-daoaodai_Dao⋅Ao⋅Dai_ltr Thu Sep 04 2025 11:43:26 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ma-cô Cuđ Jenx</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ma-cô</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt">Ma-cô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Quef coonz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz nyăngz Cuđ Jenx.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Năngđ ja yămz tâuc wac munh I-sa-ya nyăngz stâub coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mangc bex, Yaz paiđ Yaz nyăngz tâuc jenx munh ninyh đangc Mâyh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">nănh six bênc săngh Mâyh nyăngz jau;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />naih stingb lub hamv yămz stâyz phangz blănf coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Oix zuc bênc săngh Zâu nyăngz jau;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">ayx phunz Nănh nyăngz jau năngx yenh.’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yô-hanx taih, yămz stâyz phangz blănf ayx quaix-gâyf, yâuc nzaox ayx quaix-gâyf coong tauv nhlimc stoif, quanyf stoif nyăngz jau. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Lomc Yu-đê stâyz phangz cloon Yê-lu-sa-lem dlanyh munh tinyh đoih tinyh ênz taih Yô-hanx wa, stiz nhlimc stiz nyăngz stoif songđ tuz Yô-hanx yămz wa njoh đen wăngx ayx quaix-gâyf. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yô-hanx zuz nyăngz guyz quav six maf loh pyâyz, cloon nongc đupx langb stayb clai. Nănh nhlinc nyăngz six jengz đakx cloon jêmh mâyf toongh. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nănh nzônh coong: “Taih đangz yaz wax Tauh, naih lanyf naih jab năngx nzongf têx yaz, wax Tauh Yaz six max payh cumf nzac zay Nănh nyăngz stub langb. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Yaz nongc womz, stăngc nyâuh ayx quaix-gâyf, six Nănh nongc Zâu Singx-Lingh stăngc nyâuh ayx quaix-gâyf.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Yămz wax đomc noib nyăngz dlayc setb taih six năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su tăng Na-sa-leetx yămz Ga-li-lê Stâyz phangz taih, Yô-hanx songđ yămz wa njoh đen wăngx ayx quaix-gâyf phunz Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Tăng womz ah setb taih wax zanyf, Nănh phătc muif tab guungh coib goib yâuc phătc Singx-Lingh năngđ nooc bah côz nâyx nzac taih bopb Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Naih wac tăng guungh taih coong: “Mâyh six Yaz stăngz nyăngz Toonz. Yaz songđ senz numđ nyađ Mâyh nzongf.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Singx-Lingh lênh dlih paiđ Zâu Yê-su nzac stâyz phangz blănf ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Nănh yămz wa stâyz phangz blănf stâyx săpc noib zuc Sax-tanx stâyv, Nănh cloon jêmh nyăngz jămx staov yămz, yâuc naih wax đomc stinz munh taih bokc dlic Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yô-hanx zuc yămz nzauh blătc, quaix đangz Zâu Yê-su ninyh wa Ga-li-lê, nzônh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Cuđ Jenx, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Nănh coong: “Săngx huđ tauv gôh, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz senz taih tauv stătx. Oix zuc nhlimc stoif yâuc zen Cuđ Jenx.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yăngh lêpc Ga-li-lê coiđ sinh ninyh wax zanyf, Nănh phătc Si-môn cloon nănh nyăngz yâuf An-đa-lu, stiz yămz wa coiđ pungx leđ, wâyc stiz six ayx byauf munh. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Taih lêpc yaz gôh, Yaz six ayx phunz nyâuh nyăngz puf pênx ayx leđ zoz munh.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Stiz songđ lênh dlih, quanyf stiz nyăngz leđ, lêpc Zâu Yê-su ninyh.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ninyh tuz ah quăngc jau timb, Zâu Yê-su phătc Sê-bê-đi nyăngz toonz, Ya-coopc cloon nănh nyăngz yâuf Yô-hanx, stiz yămz wa đangđ va leđ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Zâu Yê-su êu stiz, stiz songđ lênh dlih quanyf stiz nyăngz pha Sê-bê-đi, cloon wax đomc congz munh yămz wa đangđ bix ninyh lêpc Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Nănh nzac Ca-bê-na-um dlanyh ninyh, six toix tingc congz noib, Zâu Yê-su songđ lênh dlih nzac wa huyđ toongh ninyh, quef coonz nzaox gâyf. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Munh songđ numđ nyâyh ganc Nănh nzaox nyăngz wac, wâyc nănh nzaox stiz naih lokc jangx nzongf, six max năngđ wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Toongx wax zanyf, naih ah lanh munh zuc manđ yootz nzac yămz stinb, yămz stiz nyăngz huyđ toongh cah njaf, nănh hamv nhlitb nhlitb têx, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />coong: “Na-sa-leetx nyăngz Zâu Yê-su lex, buz quenđ Mâyh laiv huungđ heh? Mâyh cayx taih nây mêtc buz naz? Yaz pâyz Mâyh six mănv — six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz đăngb zeengh munh!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Zâu Yê-su mađ zăpx manđ, coong: “Năngx gâyf nyaoc setb tauh munh ninyh!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Manđ yootz songđ njitc wax tauh munh glingf nzac, hamv ngatz ngatz têx, manđ songđ gâyh wax tauh munh.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Munh tinyh đoih numđ nyâyh ganc, ayx tuz stiz lanh naic lanh coong: “Nâyx đomc dlayc six ayx laix? Nzaox ah huungđ săngb gâyf senz naih lokc jangx! Ayx tuz nănh setb lanyf zăpx manđ yootz bix manđ lauf mungv Nănh.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Zâu Yê-su nyăngz manyh tauh lênh dlih tuz lănv nzêux tauv muif đoif stătx Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz wax đomc tinc.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ah yac, tăng huyđ toongh setb taih, Ya-coopc cloon Yô-hanx lêpc Zâu Yê-su buz nzac, Si-môn cloon An-đa-lu nyăngz pyau cah njaf ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Wax zanyf, Si-môn nyăngz nzif ti săngh bah song gumc, phâyx wa zâuv, stiz songđ coonx bux ănz Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Zâu Yê-su ninyh tauv stătx, nzauf nănh nyăngz puf, njăpc nyoongz quef, nănh nyăngz bah song gumc songđ gongx, nănh songđ ayx cumh pâuz bokc dlic stiz.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Tăng wa, tauv cayx nzămc, bah noib mutc zâyc, munh ênz wax đomc muif lanh săngh gumc cloon zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb wax đomc munh taih phunz Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Lomc ah nomz dlanyh munh taih dlonf yămz wa jeengh. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Zâu Yê-su zany munh đuungx nyăngz muif huungđ gumc cloon zuc jif cah munz, yâuc luiđ manđ đuungx setb, six Nănh max phunz wax đomc manđ coong wac wâyc stiz pâyz Nănh six mănv.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Bah đoomz tonx njâu, guungh năngx jinh đangh nzămc meengh, Zâu Yê-su nyoongz quef setb bah congv ninyh, Nănh ninyh tauv ah cuib tinc max naih mănv tiny, yămz wa cloo Zâu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Si-môn cloon lêpc Zâu Yê-su wax đomc munh ninyh lov Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Stiz lov pongh Nănh, songđ coong ănz Nănh coong: “Muif lanh munh jinh đangh lov Mâyh.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Pănh quaix pitc đoif ninyh gôh, ninyh yămz quib nây wax đomc njăngv, phunz yaz yămz wa nzaox gâyf, yaz taih six wâyc nâyx đomc cumh pâuz.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Nănh ninyh nzêux Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, yămz wax đomc songx munh nyăngz huyđ toongh nzaox gâyf yâuc luiđ manđ.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Wax zanyf, naih ah lanh munh zuc maoh pongz gumc taih pongh Nănh, quâyc nzac Nănh nyăngz cah đangc ninyh, joođ coong: “Năngđ coong Mâyh oix, Mâyh six naih lanyf hayh zany yaz tuz dlăngc.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Wâyc numđ hâuđ lênh, Zâu Yê-su songđ stuungb Nănh nyăngz puf, lumz wax tauh munh, yâuc coong ănz nănh: “Yaz oix lêc. Dlăngc gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Maoh pongz gumc lênh dlih gâyh nănh, nănh songđ tuz dlăngc.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Zâu Yê-su zăpx wac bux nănh tuz, songđ lênh dlih phunz nănh muf. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Nănh bux wax tauh munh: “Oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh, mâyh năngx gâyf zeengx lănv luungđ ănz mănv, six mâyh oix zuc muf, ninyh pongh stayb munh, wâyc mâyh tuz dlăngc bix oix zuc nzâyz stanyb lanyh ninyh congx, âyz Mô-sê nzaox nyăngz gâyf ayx, năngđ ah cuib zanyx manyf phunz stiz.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Six wax tauh munh, muf blătc nănh songđ lănv bux phunz munh đuungx zef nzônh nâyx đomc dlayc nzêux muif đoif, ayx tuz Zâu Yê-su max hayh toongx songx nzac laiv nomz môngf cah njaf ninyh, Nănh cungb yămz cungh ngwaic wax đomc tinc max naih munh, six songx munh tăng muif đoif yâuc taih lov Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Phunb đangz lauf wa Ca-bê-na-um dlanyh cah njaf batz noib cah đangz. Songx munh pâyz tuz coong Nănh yămz wa pyau. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Munh đuungx songđ taih căpx dlonf ayx tuz max naih tinc yămz, hănđ wa jeengh ninyh lauf yâuc max naih tinc cuungv, Zâu Yê-su songđ nzaox gâyf phunz stiz mungv. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Naih ah đomc munh taih Nănh wa, ênz cloon ah lanh munh quac taih, naih pyâyz lanh munh zeengz. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Wâyc munh hongđ nzongf max hayh ninyh tauv stătx Zâu Yê-su, stiz songđ zeb toix Zâu Yê-su yămz cah zâyc wax đomc tungh homđ, ayx tuz naih cotb, stiz songđ pungx munh quac cloon nănh phâyx wax cuib siu nzac taih. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Phătc stiz nyăngz zen stimz, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz munh quac: “Sây lex, mâyh nyăngz stoif tuz quanyf nzof gôh!”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Six wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb, năngx jinh stâyv yămz wa nyâyh ănz nyâuđ. <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Săngh laix tauh munh bix coong năngđ nâyx? Tauh munh senz coong pamf! Blătc nzuf Zâu Tênb-Huungh ah lanh, mănv naih lanyf quanyf tuz stoif?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stimz nyâuđ songđ pâyz coong stiz jinh đangh nyâyh ayx năngđ nâyx, Nănh songđ coong ănz stiz: “Săngh laix nyâuh bix nyâyh lâyc đomc ănz nyâuđ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Coong ayx laix ănz munh quac six năngx hâyđ têx, ‘Mâyh nyăngz stoif tuz quanyf nzof gôh!’ max six coong ‘Nyoongz quef, đamz mâyh nyăngz siu muf!’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Six phunz nyâuh pâyz tuz coong, Bamh Munh yămz nây bamh canz naih lokc jangx quanyf stoif”, Nănh coong bux munh quac: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Yaz bux mâyh, oix zuc nyoongz quef, đamz mâyh nyăngz siu, bix muf mâyh nyăngz pyau.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Tăng wa nănh songđ nyoongz quef lênh dlih đamz siu, quaix munh tinyh đoih cah đangc muf, ayx tuz munh tinyh đoih numđ nyâyc ganc songđ tanv Zâu Tênb-Huungh, coong: “Pănh max zeengx naih laiv zanyf phătc nâyx đomc dlayc năngđ nâyx.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Zâu Yê-su zef quaix coiđ sinh ninyh, naih munh đuungx taih Nănh wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ nzaox nănh stiz. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Jinh đangh pitb quaix ninyh wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su phătc An-phê-atc nyăngz toonz Lê-wi, stâyv yămz wa sâub sôiv zamf, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong bux nănh: “Taih lêpc yaz gôh!” Lê-wi songđ nyoongz quef, lêpc Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh đangh yămz Lê-wi nyăngz pyau nhlinc năngv wax zanyf, naih nâyx đomc dlayc setb, naih stâub sôiv munh đuungx cloon stoif nyăngz munh, stâyv wa cloon Zâu Yê-su căn Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nhlinc năngv, wâyc naih munh đuungx lêpc Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb, six Pha-li-si wax peob munh, phătc Zâu Yê-su cloon wax đomc stoif munh cloon sâub sôiv munh nhlinc năngv, stiz songđ coong ănz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayb sây: “Săngh laix Nănh bix cloon sâub sôiv munh cloon naih stoif nyăngz munh nhlinc năngv?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Numđ nâyx đomc wac, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz stiz: “Munh zoongx max sămv zuc mađ stangc, six săngh gumc munh sămv. Yaz max zâyf taih êu munh gongx, six taih êu stoif munh.” <verse eid="MRK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Six Yô-hanx wax đomc stayb sây cloon Pha-li-si munh jinh đangh njif nhlinc, nănh stiz songđ taih naic Zâu Yê-su: “Wâyc săngh laix bix Yô-hanx nyăngz stayb sây cloon Pha-li-si munh nyăngz stayb sây njif nhlinc, six Mâyh nyăngz stayb sây yâuc max njif nhlinc?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Săngb langh nyăngz zeb munh năngx yămz ayx coonx hinh waz zanyf stiz six max hayh njif nhlinc, zâyf max? Six laiv zanyf săngb langh năngx jinh cloon stiz yămz, stiz six senz max hayh njif nhlinc. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Six tauv laiv noib, săngb langh zuc ênz ninyh gâyh stiz blătc, tauv wax zanyf, yămz wax đomc noib, stiz nzăngđ njif nhlinc. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Max naih mănv va ah cuib săngb buyx ănz lôx guyz, năngđ coong naih mănv ayx năngđ nâyx, six cungb ayx phunz nyootz wax byenđ guyz nyăngz tungh va tinc byaif, săngb buyx cloon lôx buyx nyăngz tungh va tinc, zef byaif năngx lub têx. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Max naih mănv zoz săngb tiu taox ănz lôx đupx tic, six năngđ coong naih mănv ayx năngđ nâyx, săngb tiu six hayh ayx đupx tic byaif, njinh tiu cloon đupx tic zuc tađ nzuf, năngđ nâyx, săngb tiu six ănz săngb đupx tic.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Toix tingc congz noib, Zâu Yê-su clăngv quaix wax đomc njingh blauh ninyh, jămc jau ninyh wax zanyf Nănh wax đomc stayb sây songđ mătx blauh witx songz. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Pha-li-si munh coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Mangc geh, săngh laix stiz bix ayx, yămz tingc congz noib max tuz ayx nyăngz dlayc?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Nănh tauz stiz: “Nyâuh max toc quaix Đa-witx — huungh cloon lêpc nănh wax đomc munh — nyâuđ sab sămv nyăngz săngx huđ nănh stiz ayx laix haz? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ayx năngđ laix Đa-witx bix nzac bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau ninyh yămz A-bi-ya-ta ayx stayb munh pyây wax stâyv, yâuc zoz congx quaix nyăngz nzu nhlinc, wax đomc nzu six max cuib nhlinc, cungb wax đomc stayb munh nzăngđ tuz nhlinc, Đa-witx yâuc tanb phunz cloon lêpc nănh wax đomc munh?”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Nănh coong ănz stiz: “Tingc congz noib njăpc taih six wâyc bamh munh, max zâyf njăpc bamh munh wâyc tingc congz noib. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Wâyc nây, Bamh Munh, six ayx tingc congz noib nyăngz Zâu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Zâu Yê-su zef nzac huyđ toongh ninyh, yămz wa naih ah lanh munh puf quac. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Munh songđ seetx Nănh, mangc jađ yămz tingc congz noib, Nănh six zany wax tauh munh max zany, stiz nzăngđ hayh naih jau cooux Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Nănh bux wax tauh puf quac munh: “Phanv taih stâuđ nây mungh tongx.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Nănh songđ naic stiz coong: “Tingc congz noib hoopđ zuc ayx gongx max six ayx huđ; njâuv munh max six tayx munh?” Six stiz max nhlaoc tiny. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Zâu Yê-su mangc stiz numđ nhlenx yâuc numđ stauh, wâyc stiz nyăngz nyâuđ nhlengc nzongf, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz wax tauh munh: “Stuungb mâyh nyăngz puf staox taih. Nănh songđ stuungb nănh nyăngz puf staox taih bix tuz gongx.” <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Setb cungh ngwaic ninyh wax zanyf, wax đomc Pha-li-si munh cloon lêpc Hê-lôtx Huungh wax peof munh songđ lênh dlih sangv gwangh nzeengz Zâu Yê-su, ayx laix phunz stiz hayh tayx tuz Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Zâu Yê-su cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây quaix wa coiđ sinh ninyh, yâuc naih ah peof songx munh hongđ nzongf taih lêpc Nănh tăng Ga-li-lê, tăng Yu-đê, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />tăng Yê-lu-sa-lem, yâuc tăng I-đu-mê-a cloon yămz Njoh-đen wăngx toix nganc wax phanx, yâuc njinh quib yămz nzêux Tai-lapx cloon Sai-đôn dlanyh. Naih ah peob munh hongđ nzongf taih lov Zâu Yê-su, wâyc numđ lănv Nănh ayx nyăngz jau. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Wâyc munh hongđ nzongf, Zâu Yê-su songđ bux Nănh wax đomc stayb sây êu lov ah saz đangđ jenz taih phunz Nănh yămz, songx munh nzăngđ max hayh nzêmv Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Wâyc Nănh zany munh đuungx nyăngz gumc gongx, ayx tuz laiv lanh săngh gumc six zuc beengx taih stătx Nănh, nzăngđ hayh lumz tauv Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Wax đomc manđ yootz laiv zanyf phătc Zâu Yê-su, stiz songđ quâyc nzac Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah đangc ninyh, stiz yâuc hamv coong: “Mâyh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Zâu Yê-su zăpx mađ manđ max phunz stiz coong Nănh six mănv.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Zâu Yê-su staox zoongz ninyh êu Nănh oix nongc wax đomc munh, stiz songđ taih lêpc Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Zâu Yê-su sên Săpc nyâyc lanh munh (wax đomc munh Nănh yâuc hipđ ayx cumh pâuz munh), phunz stiz cloon Nănh yămz, Nănh nzăngđ hayh paiđ nănh stiz ninyh nzônh gâyf. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Yâuc sađ phunz naih lokc jangx hayh luiđ manđ <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Zâu Yê-su sên săpc nyâyc lanh munh: Si-môn, Nănh zef oonz bux pâu hipđ ayx Pi-tê; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Ya-coopc six Sê-bê-đi nyăngz toonz, cloon Yô-hanx six Ya-coopc nyăngz yâuf, Nănh zef oonz bux pâu phunz stiz hipđ ayx Bô-a-nê-yê, âyz gâyf six bah congz nyăngz toonz; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />cloon An-đa-lu, Phi-lipx, Ba-tô-lô-miu, Ma-tai, Tô-matx, An-phê-atc nyăngz toonz, Ya-coopc, Tat-đê-atc, Si-môn Sê-lôt, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />cloon maic Zâu Yê-su wax tauh Yu-đa I-sa-ca-li-ôtx.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Zâu Yê-su nzac ah sênz pyau ninyh, songx munh zef tinyh đoih taih, ayx tuz Zâu Yê-su cloon stayb sây buz lôx max hayh nhlinc nzu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Zâu Yê-su wax đomc pyau munh numđ nâyx đomc dlayc, stiz taih six oix zoz Nănh, wâyc stiz coong: “Nănh max sting nzof gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb, six tăng Yê-lu-sa-lem taih wax đomc munh, yâuc coong: “Nănh zuc Bê-ên-sê-bun manđ nzac yămz stinb,” zef coong: “Păngc manđ huungh nănh bix luiđ tuz manđ.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Six Zâu Yê-su êu stiz taih Nănh wa, yâuc nongc wac pây coong ănz stiz: “Ayx năngđ laix Sax-tanx bix hayh luiđ tuz Sax-tanx? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Năngđ coong ah nomz côkz munh cănh phunz goib taih tinyh nzeengz, wax nomz côkz six max hayh yămz tuz wăn. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Năngđ coong ah sênz pyau munh cănh phunz goib taih tinyh nzeengz, wax sênz pyau munh six max hayh yămz tuz wăn. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Năngđ coong Sax-tanx bix cănh lunc taih nzeengz Sax-tanx six zuc lunc, nănh six max hayh yămz tuz wăn, six nănh songđ zuc paic gôh. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Six max naih mănv hayh nzac munh njoongh nyăngz pyau ninyh zab nănh nyăngz jax toongx, six cungb oix zuc stayb wax tauh munh njoongh đangc, nzăngđ hayh zab tuz nănh nyăngz jax toongx. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, bamh munh ayx longđ nyăngz muif huungđ stoif cloon stiz coong pamf nyăngz muif zâux wac six tuz quanyf nzuf, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />six laiv lanh coong pamf nzeengz Zâu Singx-Lingh, six banc stâyv banc đaic max tuz quanyf stoif, nănh six zuc stâyv quâyx đamz stoif.” — <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Nănh coong nâyx six wâyc stiz coong: “Nănh zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Zâu Yê-su nyăngz nzif cloon Nănh wax đomc yâuf taih tauv, stâuđ yămz wa cungh ngwaic, stiz êu munh stăngc bux Zâu Yê-su, êu Nănh setb taih. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Naih ah peof munh hongđ stâyv quib Zâu Yê-su, munh songđ coong bux Nănh: “Phanv mangc, mâyh nyăngz nzif cloon mâyh nyăngz yâuf yămz wa cungh ngwaic, lov mâyh.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Mănv six yaz nyăngz nzif, yaz nyăngz yâuf pez?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Nănh songđ winb mangc stâyv quib Nănh wa cah stinh wax đomc munh, yâuc coong: “Phanv mangc, nây six yaz nyăngz nzif cloon yaz nyăngz yâuf pez! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Laiv lanh ayx âyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz zux ix, wax tauh six yaz nyăngz yâuf pez, ô stayx, cloon yaz nyăngz nzif.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Naih ah hâyđ, Zâu Yê-su yămz wa coiđ sinh quef coonz nzaox gâyf, naih ah peob munh hongđ nzongf taih căpx dlonf quib Nănh. Wâyc nâyx, Nănh songđ nzac ah saz đangđ ninyh stâyv yămz wa womz minc, năngx naih wax đomc songx munh six yămz wa coiđ sinh. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Nănh nongc wac pây nzaox đuungx huungđ bux stiz, Nănh nzaox nyăngz săngx huđ, Nănh coong: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mungv bex! Wex, naih ah lanh ayx njăngx munh setb ninyh hav nhlimb. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Hav nhlimb Munh hav wax zanyf naih nâyx đomc dlayc setb, ah po nhlimb tuih nzac jau, nooc songđ taih nhlinc wax đomc nhlimb nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Naih ah po nhlimb tuih nzac njăuz poz, wax cuib tinc max naih nib phănx huv, nhlimb songđ bêux căn, wâyc zuc plopx max đôz. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Six tauv bah noib setb taih, njăngx zuc njic toc plaz, songđ zuc njeengh caođ nzuf, wâyc max naih đungh. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Naih ah po tuih nzac nzim plungz, nzim lub taih nzimx nzuf songđ max hayh săngh tuz pyâu. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Năngx naih ah po nhlimb tuih nzac nib gongx, wax đomc nhlimb songđ bêux nzuf lub taih nănh songđ săngh pyâu, ah po tuz stamx săpc, ah po tuz guc săpc, cloon ah po tuz ah pez.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Zâu Yê-su songđ coong: “Laiv lanh naih bah noomh nongc mungv, oix zuc mungv.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Zâu Yê-su cănh lanyc ah lanh yămz wax zanyf, yămz Nănh cah sinh wax đomc munh cloon wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây songđ naic Nănh wax đomc wac pây. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz, coong: “Yămz Tênb-toongh côkz wax đomc pinyx nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh phunz nyâuh pâyz nzof gôh, six cah sinh wax đomc munh, muif huungđ six cungb wac pây nzuf,<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />stiz hănđ mangc, lauf mangc max phătc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">stiz hănđ mungv, lauf mungv max numđ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">săngx đanyf, stiz saz tuz bix coi nyâuđ songđ tuz quanyf stoif.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh max saz tuz nâyx đomc wac pây haz? Năngđ nâyx nyâuh laiv ayx laix hayh saz tuz nzuf muif huungđ wac pây heh? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Hav nhlimb nyăngz munh six hav Cuđ Jenx. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Zef nây six tuih zuc jau wax đomc munh, stiz mungv numđ Cuđ Jenx blătc wax zanyf, Sax-tanx lênh dlih taih zoz setb ninyh nzuf stiz numđ nyăngz Cuđ Jenx. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Lauf tinyh năngđ, nây six tuih zuc njăuz poz wax đomc munh, six pây wax đomc munh stiz numđ Cuđ Jenx wax zanyf, yâuc coonx numđ nyađ stipx Cuđ Jenx, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />six stiz max naih đuungh yămz stiz nyăngz nyâuđ songđ zen max lauh. Six tauv wâyc Cuđ Jenx pongh zuc ayx huđ max six zâuđ nanc, stiz songđ setb taih. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ah phanx six wax đomc tuih nzac nzim plungz nyăngz munh. Nây six wax đomc munh numđ Cuđ jenx, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />six wâyc quenđ nyâuđ stâyv sangc nyăngz jau cloon nyâyh puf quâyx nyăngz jau, cloon mauh oix tuz muif huungđ nyăngz jau taih zanb, plongz cuđ jenx ayx tuz cuđ jenx max săngh pyâu. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Zef nây six wax đomc munh yămz wa nib gongx tuz numđ Cuđ Jenx, six wax đomc munh numđ Cuđ Jenx yâuc zen, songđ săngh pyâu nyăuh, tuz stamx săpc, tuz guc săpc, yâuc tuz ah pez.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Zâu Yê-su coong bux stiz: “Pu toongz max zâyf nongc tăpx ănz wa cah đi tongđ njaf max six zâuv đi toix max? Max zâyf nongc tăpx ănz wa toongz zax haz? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Wâyc max naih laiv huungđ vâyv bix max zuc setb nzăngc, yâuc max naih laiv huungđ pinyx tuz vâyv bix max zuc zoz setb taih payb manyf. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh naih bah noomh nongc mungv, oix zuc mungv.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Nănh songđ coong bux stiz: “Oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh nyâuh tuz numđ nyăngz dlayc. Nyâuh gaob buc laiv, nyâuh lauf tuz clao buc wa, nyâuh zef tuz pâu năngx đuungx têx timb. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Wâyc laiv lanh naih nănh six tuz pâu, năngx naih laiv lanh max naih, max cun nănh naih laiv huungđ, six lauf zuc zoz ninyh gâyh Nănh.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Zâu Yê-su coong: “Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz six nâyx: Cayx năngđ ah lanh munh ninyh hav nhlimb ănz wa njăngx, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />nănh mâyc njoomh max six điub, bah nzămc max six bah noib zax, nhlimb cănh bêux nyah lub taih ayx năngđ laix — nănh yâuc max pâyz. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Nib cănh phunz bêux lub taih săngh pyâu âyz nănh nyăngz zux ix: tah yetx six miuh, tăng wa zef tauv blauh songz đongx phăngh, zef naih zub jăuh yămz wa blauh songz. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Tauv blauh wăngh, wax lanh munh songđ coonx nzâyz bah tôz ninyh quănf, wâyc stâub zunb nyăngz săngx huđ tauv.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Zâu Yê-su coong: “Pănh cayx pây Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz ayx năngđ laix, max six pănh cayx nongc laiv huungđ wac pây tuz setb wax nomz côkz? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Pây năngđ ah nomz njayz jaix nhlimb, six wax nomz nhlimb tuz songx nzac nib ninyh, six năngx stăm quaix muif huungđ nhlimb yămz nây nib minc, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />tauv songx tuz blătc, nănh bêux staox taih săngh năngx lub têx muif huungđ njayz yămz wa lauđ winb, yâuc naih wax đomc quah lub, ayx tuz nooc năngx hayh ayx njauf ănz nănh nyăngz glomx.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Zâu Yê-su nongc đuungx huungđ wac pây năngđ nây nâyx, nzaox gâyf phunz stiz, âyz stiz hayh saz tuz, <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Nănh max nzaox laiv huungđ phunz stiz bix max nongc wac pây, six yămz lanyc wax zanyf, Nănh pob manyf muif huungđ dlayc phunz Nănh wax đomc stayb sây.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Lauf wax noib, tauv guungh cayx nzămc, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stayb sây buz: “Pănh zuc clăngv quaix wax nganđ leepz coiđ sinh ninyh.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Gâyh songx munh blătc, wâyc Zâu Yê-su six yămz wa đangđ. Stayb sây buz songđ ênz Nănh cloon stiz ninyh, yâuc naih ah đomc đangđ lêpc Nănh ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Naih ah tâuc nzaox lub nzongf staox taih, sâyb womz phatb nzac đangđ ninyh ayx tuz đangđ womz cayx pong. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Six Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh yămz wa đangđ tây, nzomx tungh nzomx mâyc njoomh. Stayb sây buz êu Nănh điub songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Stayb pha lex, pănh cayx tayc gôh nef mâyh max numđ stauh haz?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nyoongz quef taih, zăpx nzaox yâuc coong ănz coiđ womz: “Tingc gôh! Gâyf tongf gôh!” Năngđ nâyx, nzaox songđ tingc, sec dlakc têx nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh Săngh laiv bix cumh nzav? Nyâuh lauf max zeengx naih zen stimz haz?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Stiz senz numđ cumh nzav nzongf stiz songđ lanh coong ănz lanh: “Nâyx lanh munh six mănv, njinh nzaox cloon womz lauf zuc mungv Nănh nyăngz wac.”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Stiz songđ ninyh tauv wax leepz coiđ sinh, tauv Yê-la-sa nib tâyc. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Zâu Yê-su setb đangđ taih wax zanyf, songđ, naih ah lanh munh zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb tăng wa stâu đungc nzac taih pongh Nănh, <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />nâyx lanh munh nyăngz tinc six yămz wax đomc stâu đungc, max naih mănv hayh nzauf nănh tuz blaz, hănđ nongc njab langb stayb lauf max tuz, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />wâyc đuungx hâyđ munh nongc ja cloon njab langb stayb nănh, six njab langb nănh yâuc tăkc setc, năngx naih ja nănh bopc huđ nzuf, max naih mănv naih jab nzauf tuz nănh blaz. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Quaix noib quaix munf yămz wax đomc stâu đungc cloon wax đomc zoongz zâyc, nănh hamv nhlitb nhlitb têx, cănh zoz njăuz njayc catz nănh nyăngz stinb. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Tăng năngx jinh yămz côz côz nănh mangc phătc Zâu Yê-su, songđ tiuv nzac taih quâyc nzac Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah đangc ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Nănh nzac jab hamv lub coong: “Yămz njăngb quaix Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz, Yê-su lex, yaz quenđ mâyh laiv huungđ? Yaz tim Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz manyh joođ mâyh, năngx gâyf wâyb yaz.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Wâyc Zâu Yê-su êu nănh, coong: “Manđ yootz lex, oix zuc setb nâyx tauh munh ninyh.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Zâu Yê-su naic nănh: “Mâyh nyăngz bux hipđ ayx luungđ?” Nănh tauz Zâu Yê-su: “Yaz nyăngz bux hipđ ayx peengz peob, wâyc buz hongđ nzongf.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Nănh songđ nzac jab joođ Zâu Yê-su coong êu Nănh năngx gâyf luiđ nănh stiz setb wax nomz stâyz phangz. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Wax zanyf, naih ah peof tungf hongđ nzongf jinh đangh yămz wax zâyđ zoongz lov nhlinc, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />wax đomc manđ songđ joođ Zâu Yê-su, coong: “Joođ phunz buz nzac wax peof tungf ninyh, buz nzăngđ hayh nzac wax peob tungf.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nyenc phunz nănh stiz setb ninyh, wax zanyf wax đomc manđ songđ nzac wax peob tungf ninyh, wax peob tungf — cox naih iz tinb tauh nâyx — tăng wa zoongz nzaz tiuv nzac coiđ ninyh sêmh coiđ tayc nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Wax đomc jămđ tungf munh songđ tiuv muf lănv nâyx đomc dlayc bux wa dlanyh cah njaf cloon wax đomc njăngv sangc nyăngz munh, munh đuungx songđ setb ninyh mangc jađ naih laiv huungđ dlayc setb. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Stiz ninyh tauv Zâu Yê-su wa songđ phătc zuc manđ ayx wax tauh — six cah đangc zuc peengz peob manđ nzac yămz stinb wax tauh munh — stâyv yămz wa, zuz guyz quav sting plongx munh, stiz songđ numđ cumh nzav nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Wax đomc munh phătc songđ lănv bux stiz tauv cah đangc zuc manđ yămz stinb wax tauh munh cloon wax peob tungf nyăngz jau six ayx năngđ laix. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Stiz goib nzetx nzac jab joođ Zâu Yê-su, êu ninyh gâyh stiz nyăngz stâyz phangz. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Zâu Yê-su nzac đangđ wax zanyf, cah đangc zuc manđ yămz stinb wax lanh munh, joođ Zâu Yê-su phunz nănh cloon Zâu Yê-su yămz. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Six Zâu Yê-su max phunz, songđ bux nănh coong: “Phanv muf mâyh nyăngz pyau, ninyh pongh mâyh nyăngz pyau munh, bix lănv bux stiz Zâu ayx nyăngz dlayc lub phunz mâyh, Nănh yâuc hâuđ lênh mâyh ayx năngđ laix.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Wax lanh munh songđ ninyh, yămz Tôt-bu-li stâyz phangz quef coonz lănv Zâu Yê-su ayx nyăngz dlayc lub năngđ laix phunz nănh, munh tinyh đoih songđ numđ nyâyc ganc nzongf.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su nzac đangđ ninyh clăngv quaix wax nganđ leepb coiđ sinh muf timb, Naih ah peof songx munh hongđ nzongf taih căpx dlonf wâyh nzêux Nănh, Nănh yâuc năngx jinh yămz wa coiđ sinh. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Phanv mangc, naih ah lanh six cun huyđ toongh nyăngz munh, bux hipđ ayx Yai-latx, taih tauv, phătc Zâu Yê-su, nănh songđ quâyc nzac Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staux ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Nănh nzac jab joođ Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz nyăngz sab jenz cayx tayc gôh. Joođ mâyh ninyh tăpx puf ănz nănh phunz nănh nzăngđ tuz zany gongx, yâuc tuz săngh.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su songđ lêpc nănh muf, naih ah peof songx munh hongđ nzongf lauf lêpc Nănh ninyh yâuc quib nzêux Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Naih ah lanh munh nzif săngh đuv guyz max gaib nyăngz gumc tuz săpc nyâyc nyăngv, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />zuc tanyđ bah laiv săngb munz lov mađ stangc munh đuungx zany, nongc nănh nyăngz muif huungđ jax toongx gaib nzuf, gumc yâuc max gongx tiny, six blătc quaiz đangz, gumc zef năngx niđ têx, <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />numđ munh lănv tauv Zâu Yê-su, nănh songđ beengx nzac wax peob songx munh hongđ ninyh tauv Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah đangz, nănh songđ lumz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz guyz. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Wâyc wax tauh munh nzif nyâyh coong: “Yaz năngđ coong phanv lumz tauv Nănh nyăngz guyz cuungv yaz nyăngz gumc six tuz gongx.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Toongx wax zanyf, nănh nyăngz đuv guyz samđ songđ gaib, nănh songđ numđ nănh nyăngz stinb, tuz zany gumc gongx. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Zâu Yê-su lênh dlih pâyz, tăng Nănh nyăngz stinb naih jab setb ninyh, Nănh songđ yămz songx munh mungh tongx winb đangz naic coong; “Mănv lumz yaz nyăngz guyz heh?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây tauz Nănh: “Stayb pha phătc munh hongđ jinh đangh nzêmv mâyh, mâyh zef năngx naic coong: ‘Mănv lumz yaz’ naz?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Zâu Yê-su lauf jinh đangh winb mangc winb mangc jađ mănv ayx nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Wax zanyf, wax tauh munh nzif, pâyz tuz nănh nyăngz jau setb taih, songđ cumh nzav, stinb sinx nzuf, taih, quâyc nzac Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah đangc ninyh, lănv nzuf nănh nyăngz dlayc bux Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Six Zâu Yê-su coong ănz wax tauh munh nzif: “Sây sab lex, mâyh nyăngz zen stimz cănh zany mâyh nyăngz gumc gongx. Phanv peengh oonz muf bex, mâyh nyăngz gumc gâyh nzuf nzof gôh.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh coong wac wax zanyf, naih ah đomc munh tăng cun huyđ toongh wax tauh munh nyăngz pyau taih bux coong: “Mâyh nyăngz sab tayc nzof gôh. Săngh laix năngx wâyb stênx steengb heh?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Six mungv numđ stiz coong nyăngz wac, Zâu Yê-su bux cun huyđ toongh wax tauh munh coong: “Năngx gâyf cumh nzav bex. Cungb phanv zen lêc.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Nănh max phunz laiv lanh lêpc Nănh ninyh, cungb ênz Pi-tê, Ya-coopc cloon Ya-coopc nyăngz yâuf Yô-hanx ninyh cuungv. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ninyh tauv cun huyđ toongh wax tauh munh nyăngz pyau, Zâu Yê-su phătc munh lunc nzuf yâuc hamv haoh nhlitb nhlitb têx. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Japc nzac ninyh wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Săngh laix nyâuh bix numđ stauh haoh heh? Tauh sây max tayc nef, nănh cungb mâyc njoomh lêc.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Tăng wa stiz songđ pib jetx Zâu Yê-su, Nănh songđ luiđ wax đomc munh setb cungh ngwaic ninyh nzuf, Nănh cungb ênz wax tauh munh sây nyăngz nzif, pha cloon lêpc Nănh wax đomc munh, Nănh songđ ninyh tauv munh sây phâyx wax cuib tinc. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nzauf wax tauh sây nyăngz puf, yâuc coong bux nănh: “Ta-li-ta-cu-mi!” âyz gâyf six coong: “Sab jenz lex, yaz bux mâyh điub nyoongz quef gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Toongx sangf, wax tauh sây songđ nyoongz quef yăngh (wâyc nănh six săpc nyâyc nyăngv), wax đomc munh yămz wa senz numđ nyâyh ganc nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Zâu Yê-su zăpx êu stiz coong năngx gâyf lănv nâyx đomc dlayc bux laiv tauh, Nănh songđ êu stiz phunz wax tauh sây nhlinc.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Zâu Yê-su gâyh wax nomz tinc, songđ phunb đangz muf Nănh nyăngz stâyz phangz, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây yâuc lêpc Nănh muf. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Tauv tingc congz noib, Zâu Yê-su yămz wa huyđ toongh quef coonz nzaox gâyf. Munh đuungx numđ songđ nyâyc ganc, stiz coong: “Nzaox nâyx đomc gâyf six tăng laiv tix zoz taih loz? Nănh tuz sađ nyăngz tongb manyh cloon đuungx huungđ jix caox njingc năngđ nâyx, yămz Nănh nyăngz puf tauh setb taih six ayx laix? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nây six max zâyf ayx njăngx stangc munh, ayx Ma-li-ya nyăngz toonz, Ya-coopc, Yô-sê, Yu-đatc cloon Si-môn nyăngz tah haz? Nănh wax đomc muc max zâyf cloon pănh yămz nây nâyx đomc mah?” Stiz songđ nzêmh Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Zâu Yê-su coong bux stiz: “Tâuc wac munh six max yêmv munh zanyb, cungb cănh Nănh nyăngz stâyz phangz, cloon nănh nyăngz njăngv njaf munh cloon nănh nyăngz pyau munh max zanyb.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yămz wa Zâu Yê-su max hayh ayx laiv huungđ jix caox njingc, Nănh cungb tăpx puf ănz zany munh stoc nzongf nyăngz gumc. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Zâu Yê-su phătc njingc nzongf wâyc zuc stiz max zen, Nănh songđ ninyh quib wax đomc njăngv nzaox gâyf.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Nănh êu săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây taih songđ quef coonz paiđ stiz setb ninyh, ninyh ah toix ah toix têx, Nănh yâuc sađ phunz stiz naih lokc jangx luiđ tuz muif huungđ manđ. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Yâuc bux stiz coong setb jau năngx gâyf nzâyz laiv huungđ ninyh, cungb nzâyz ah stinz pya byac cuungv — gâyf nzâyz nzu, gâyf nzâyz tic, yâuc năngx gâyf nzâyz nyanh ănz quav langb ninyh — <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />tapc stub ninyh, six “Nyâuh năngx gâyf zuz iz byenđ guyz.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Laiv zanyf nyâuh nzac laiv sênz pyâu ninyh, phanv yămz wa ayx tuz tauv laiv zanyf nyâuh setb wax sênz pyau. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Toix laiv tix tinc max stipx nyâuh, max six max mungv nyâuh, tauv gâyh wax nomz tinc, phanv phătb nyâuh nyăngz staux đi nyăngz nib buungb, năngđ ah cuib zanyx manyf nzeengz stiz.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Năngđ nâyx, stayb sây buz songđ setb jau ninyh, nzaox gâyf coong muif lanh munh oix zuc nhlimc stoif. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Stiz luiđ manđ đuungx setb, yâuc nongc yâuh hâuh ănz đuungx lanh gumc munh yâuc zany stiz nyăngz gumc gongx.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Tăng wa, Hê-lôtx huungh mungv numđ nâyx đomc jau, wâyc zuc Zâu Yê-su nyăngz manyh tauh tuz lănv nzêux muif đoif, munh songđ coong: “Yô-hanx Quaix-gâyf tuz tăng tayc săngh taih, wâyc năngđ nâyx yămz nâyx tauh munh nzăngđ naih lokc jangx ayx tuz jix caox njingc.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Năngx naih ah phanx munh coong: “Nănh six Ê-li-ya.” Naih ah phanx yâuc coong: “Nănh six ah tauh tâuc wac munh, năngđ ah lanh lôx noib wax đomc tâuc wac munh.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Six numđ coong ayx nâyx, Hê-lôtx songđ coong: “Yô-hanx, six yaz cumv pyây wax tauh, nănh zef năngx tuz săngh taih.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Wâyc senz Hê-lôtx, paiđ munh ninyh, zoz Yô-hanx stayb nănh ănz nzauh wâyc Hê-lô-đêtc wax cuyb zăngc (Hê-lôtx nyăngz yâuf, Phi-lipx nyăngz au) wâyc Hê-lôtx zoz Hê-lô-đêtc nongc ayx au. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Wâyc Yô-hanx bux Hê-lôtx coong: “Mâyh senz max naih gâyf zoz mâyh nyăngz yâuf nyăngz au nzâyz taih nongc.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Wâyc nâyx Hê-lô-đêtc numđ nhlenx Yô-hanx nzongf oix tayx nănh, six nănh max hayh, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />wâyc Hê-lôtx cumh nzav Yô-hanx, wâyc nănh pâyz Yô-hanx six ah lanh munh peengh stimz, munh stimz đăngb, wâyc năngđ nâyx Hê-lôtx yâuc max ayx laix ănz nănh, mungv Yô-hanx coong, nănh hănđ numđ nhlenx, nănh yâuc pungx nyâuđ mungv Yô-hanx. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Tauv naih săngx huđ congv, six toix Hê-lôtx bênc nănh nyăngz siny nyâtc năngv, tinyđ ayx quanz bây nănh wax đomc munh cloon ayx peengz pyây wax đomc munh cloon yămz Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz wax đomc quanz taih songc nhlinc. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Six wax zanyf Hê-lô-đêtc nyăngz sab songđ nzac ninyh, tiuh loongc, ayx phunz Hê-lôtx cloon nănh stâyv wa hinh wax đomc jenb numđ hoopđ nyâuđ nzuf, wâyc nâyx Hê-lôtx songđ coong ănz wax tauh sab: “Mâyh oix nongc toix laiv huungđ bix phanv joođ, yaz six phunz wax huungđ mâyh.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Hê-lôtx Huungh songđ nyunc wac cloon wax tauh sab coong: “Mâyh hănđ joođ yaz nyăngz ah phanx côkz, yaz yâuc phunz mâyh.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Năngđ nâyx, wax tauh sab setb cungh ngwaic ninyh, songđ naic nănh nyăngz nzif: “Yaz cayx joođ luungđ loz?” Wax tauh nzif songđ tauz: “Joođ Yô-hanx Quaix-gâyf wax tauh nyăngz pyây.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Wax tauh sab lênh dlih, coonx phunb đangz lauf Hê-lôtx wa, joođ: “Yaz oix nongc Huungh pha toongx nâyx zanyf phunz Yaz Yô-hanx Quaix-gâyf wax tauh nyăngz pyây tăpx ănz hinh cah zâyc.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Hănđ numđ stauh nzuf, Huungh lauf max oix pyenv wax tauh sab, wâyc zuc nănh nyunc nyăngz wac yâuc naih wax đomc jenb jinh đangh cloon nănh stâyv yămz wa hinh, <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />huungh songđ lênh dlih, paiđ peengz ninyh, êu nzâyz Yô-hanx nyăngz pyây taih, peengz setb cungh ngwaic ninyh, songđ nzac wa nzauh ninyh cumv Yô-hanx nyăngz pyây. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Peengz nzâyz Yô-hanx nyăngz pyây taih ănz wa hinh songđ jaoz pyây phunz wax tauh sab, wax tauh sab songđ jaoz phunz nănh nyăngz nzif. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Yô-hanx wax đomc stayb sây, numđ lănv songđ taih, zoz Yô-hanx nyăngz stayđ, yâuc nzâyz ninyh wa stâu plopx.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Stayb sây buz songđ cloon Zâu Yê-su căpx dlonf, lănv stiz ayx nyăngz muif huungđ dlayc cloon stiz nzaox wax đomc gâyf bux Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Nyâuh oix zuc cănh ninyh lanyc tix đoif max naih munh, yămz wa sec hitb conv tix cay.” Wâyc zuc naih munh đuungx nzongf quaix ninyh quaix lauf, ayx tuz stiz lôx max naih congv nhlinc. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Stiz tinyh đoih nzac đangc ninyh tauv ah cuib tinc max naih munh yămz. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Naih munh đuungx phătc stiz setb ninyh yâuc saz tuz stiz, songđ naih munh tăng nzêux wax đomc môngf, tinyh ênz tiuv ninyh tauv wax cuib tinc đangc stiz. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Tauv setb đangc taih, Zâu Yê-su phătc ah peob songx munh hongđ nzongf, Nănh songđ numđ hâuđ lênh stiz wâyc stiz cayx năngđ pax jiz yuungh nâyx max naih munh jămđ, Nănh songđ quef coonz nzaox stiz đuungx huungđ. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Wax zanyf yâuc cayx nzămc gôh, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây songđ taih bux Nănh coong: “Nâyx cuib six tinc lanyc max naih munh yămz nâyx zanyf yâuc nzămc yongb nzof. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Joođ phunz songx munh muf gôh, phunz stiz muf nzac yămz quib nây wax đomc njăngv, stiz nzăngđ cănh hayh maif tix huungđ nongc nhlinc.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Six Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz, coong: “Nyâuh cănh zuc phunz stiz nhlinc.” Stiz tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Ha tauv ninyh, buz bix zuc maif tuz iz pez noib congz nyanh nyăngz nzu phunz songx munh nhlinc naz?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz stiz: “Phanv ninyh. Lov mangc jađ. Nyâuh naih bah laiv nomz nzu?” Zah naic tuz, stiz tauz: “Naih pyaz nomz nzu cloon iz tauh byauf.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Zâu Yê-su êu songx munh muif lanh stâyv nzac wa mađ meengz cah zâyc ninyh ayx săngh đomc săngh đomc têx. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Stiz stâyv nzac phunz ayx săngh đomc, lauh đomc ah pez lanh cloon lauh đomc yâuc ngâuf săpc lanh. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nzauf wa pyaz nomz nzu cloon iz tauh byauf, zaub minb staox guungh ninyh, sâuf hâuđ tuz songđ watz nzu taih jaoz phunz Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nzâyz ninyh patz phunz songx munh, Nănh yâuc patz wa iz tauh byauf phunz munh tinyh đoih. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Songx munh tinyh đoih yâuc tuz nhlinc pêu nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Stayb sây buz sâub wax đomc nzu cloon byauf yăngc tuz săpc nyâyc đanz pong. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Tuz nhlinc nzu wax đomc munh cox naih pyaz tinb lanh munh pha.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Zâu Yê-su coonx, yac Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nzac đangđ ninyh đangc, quaix wax nganđ leepz coiđ sinh muf, ninyh Bêtx-sai-đa, Nănh cănh yămz wa êu songx munh phunb đangz muf. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Songx munh muf blătc, Zâu Yê-su songđ staox zoongz ninyh cloo Zâu. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Tauv nzămc, đangđ songđ yămz wa coiđ stimz, six Zâu Yê-su cănh ah lanh yămz wa coiđ sinh. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Phătc stiz jinh đangh nongc jab tâuc đangđ — wâyc nzaox sâyb phunb đangz — six wax munf cox pyâyz săngx huđ njâu, Nănh yăngh quaix womz minc taih stayb sây buz wa, Nănh yâuc oix pitb stiz. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Six stayb sây buz mangc phătc Nănh yăngh yămz wa womz minc, stăngz coong Nănh six zuungb, stiz songđ hamv ngatz ngatz têx, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />wâyc stiz muif lanh phătc Nănh songđ numđ cumh nzav nzongf. Six Zâu Yê-su lênh dlih, coong bux stiz: “Phanv pungx nyâuđ bex! Yaz lêc! Năngx gâyf cumh nzav!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Nănh songđ japc nzac đangc ninyh cloon stiz yămz wa nzaox songđ tingc nzac, stayb sây buz senz numđ njingc nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Wâyc zuc stiz max manyh pec tauv wax đomc nzu nyăngz âyz gâyf, wâyc năngđ nâyx, stiz nyăngz nyâuđ yâuc năngx nhlengc.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Clăngv tauv wax nganđ lepb coiđ sinh, stiz songđ ninyh tauv Gên-nê-sa-lêtx bix zapz đangđ ănz wa. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Stiz setb đangđ taih wax zanyf, wâyc munh saz coong Zâu Yê-su, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />munh songđ coonx tiuv muf nzêux wax nomz stâyz phangz yâuc zeengz wax đomc săngh gumc munh phâyx wa zâuv wa đomc taih tauv, stiz numđ coong Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh yămz wax đomc tinc. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Tinyh phanv Zâu Yê-su nzac laiv tix ninyh, yămz wax đomc njăngv dlonf, max six yămz njăngv lanyc, max six yămz môngf cah njaf, songx munh yâuc ênz wax đomc gumc munh taih ănz wa caiz sangc joođ Nănh, tinyh phanv năngx phunz stiz tuz lumz tauv Nănh nyăngz guyz saz, toix laiv lanh lumz tauv Nănh gumc yâuc tuz gongx.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Wax đomc Pha-li-si munh cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb, tăng Yê-lu-sa-lem taih, căpx dlonf quib Zâu Yê-su wa. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Wâyc nănh stiz phătc Zâu Yê-su ah đomc stayb sây, nhlinc nzu nyăngz săngx huđ puf naih wâyx, wâyc stiz max zeengx đaox puf. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Wâyc Pha-li-si munh cloon yetx stong Yu-tai munh năngđ coong max zeengx đaox stiz nyăngz puf dlăngc stiz six max nhlinc, wâyc âyz nănh stiz nyăngz claof jex nyăngz stu stongz gâyf ayx; <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Nzâyz tăng caiz lauf wax đomc, năngđ coong max zeengx ayx gâyf đaox quaix nănh stiz six max nhlinc, zef năngx naih đuungx huungđ gâyf phunz nănh stiz nongc ayx âyz timb: ayx gâyf đaox zan banh, mo zeengb, cloon nongc tongh ayx nyăngz tungh zăngc.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Wax đomc Pha-li-si munh cloon nzaox gâyf nyăngz stênx steengb songc naic Zâu Yê-su: “Săngh laix Mâyh nyăngz stayb sây max ayx âyz claof jex buz nyăngz stu stongz gâyf, max zeengx đaox puf bix nhlinc nzu?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Six Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh stiz coong: “Tâuc wac munh, I-sa-ya coong tuz toix nyâuh đomc pâyc zac nyâuđ yootz nyăngz munh. Năngđ naih ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Nâyx stingx munh nongc nzetx zanyb yaz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">six nănh stiz nyăngz nyâuđ gâyh yaz côz nzongf.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Nănh stiz canyx bongc Yaz six max săngh nongc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">wâyc nănh stiz nzaox nyăngz gâyf six bamh munh njăpc taih yâuc nzaox năngđ senz gâyf nâyx.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nyâuh quanyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz gâyf njanh, yâuc ayx âyz bamh munh njăpc taih nyăngz stu stongz gâyf.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Zâu Yê-su songđ bux nănh stiz: “Nyâuh senz yoiz quanyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz gâyf bix cănh âyz nyâuh nyăngz stu stongz gâyf ayx! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Wâyc Mô-sê nzaox coong: ‘Oix zuc jâuz mâyh nyăngz nzif cloon mâyh nyăngz pha,’ Zef coong ‘Laiv lanh zaux nzif max six pha, wax tauh six zuc tayx tayc.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Six nyâuh coong: ‘Năngđ coong ah lanh munh coong ănz nănh nyăngz nzif max six pha coong: “Naih laiv huungđ nzif pha hoopđ tuz sây stăngc nyăngz jau six Cô-la-ban (âyz gâyf six jax dlaih stungx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh),”’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />six nyâuh max phunz wax lanh munh ayx toix laiv huungđ stăngc nănh nyăngz nzif max six pha, <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />nyâuh ayx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz wac max săngh nongc năngđ nyâuh njăpc taih nyăngz stu stongz gâyf, nyâuh yâuc ayx đuungx huungđ dlayc năngđ nây nâyx.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Zâu Yê-su zef êu songx munh taih, songđ coong bux stiz: “Nyâuh muif lanh oix zuc mungv yaz yâuc oix zuc manyh pec: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />max naih laiv huungđ tăng cungh ngwaic nzac ah lanh munh ninyh bix hayh ayx wâyx nănh; six tăng munh nyâuđ njaf setb wax đomc nzăngđ hayh ayx wâyx munh.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />(Năngđ coong laiv lanh naih bah noomh nongc mungv, oix zuc mungv.)<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Zâu Yê-su gâyh songx munh nzac pyau muf wax zanyf, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây songđ naic Nănh wax tiuh wac pây. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Zâu Yê-su coong bux nănh stiz: “Năngđ nâyx nyâuh lauf max saz haz? Nyâuh max pâyz coong muif huungđ tăng cungh ngwaic nzac ah lanh munh six max hayh ayx nănh zuc wâyx haz? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Wâyc nhlinc nyăngz tax huungđ max nzac munh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ, six nzac stib muf, songđ ninyh setb ayx queengx (âyz gâyf muif huungđ nhlinc hopb six dlăngc.)” <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Six Zâu Yê-su coong: “Laiv huungđ tăng munh setb taih wax huungđ nzăngđ hayh ayx wâyx munh. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Wâyc yămz cah njaf, six tăng munh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ setb, nyâyh setb wax đomc huđ dlayc, ayx pongz lauh, ayx stac, tayx munh, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />văngf munh, mauh tax huungđ, nyâuđ jaz, puv maoh jaf munh, bah camx bah caiz, hănđ munh, pib mađ munh, ayx lub, siv lub. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Nâyx đomc muif huungđ huđ dlayc six tăng nyâuđ njaf setb taih yâuc ayx phunz munh naih wâyx.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nyoongz quef gâyh wax nomz tinc, ninyh tauv Tai-lapx cloon Sai-đôn stâyz phangz, songđ nzac ah sênz pyau ninyh, Nănh max oix nongc mănv pâyz, six Nănh lauf pinyx max tuz. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Six naih ah lanh munh nzif, nănh naih ah lanh sab jenz, nănh nyăngz sab zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb, wâyc nănh numđ lănv tauv Zâu Yê-su, songđ lênh dlih taih tauv, quâyc nzac Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staux ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Wax zanyf, wax tauh munh nzif six Hi-lapc munh, nănh nyăngz coonz six yămz Si-li-phi-ni-sê, nănh songđ joođ Zâu Yê-su êu Zâu Yê-su luiđ manđ setb nănh nyăngz sab. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz wax tauh munh nzif coong: “Tah yetx, six zuc phunz sây tuz nhlinc pêu đangc, senz max hoopđ zuc zoz sây nyăngz nzu quanyf phunz clô nhlinc.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Six wax tauh munh nzif zef tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Toix gôh, Zâu lex, six yămz wa đah mâyf đi wax đomc clô jenz lauf ston sây nyăngz nzu pâyv nhlinc.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Năngđ nâyx Zâu Yê-su songđ bux nănh: “Wâyc nâyx cuib wac, mâyh phanv muf gôh. Manđ setb mâyh nyăngz sab nzof.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Muf tauv nănh nyăngz pyau, wax tauh munh nzif phătc nănh nyăngz sây phâyx wa zâuv, manđ yâuc setb nzof gôh.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Năngx naih ah hâyđ timb, Zâu Yê-su ninyh gâyh wa Tai-lapx stâyz phangz, quaix Si-đôn dlanyh ninyh tauv Ga-li-lê coiđ, zef ninyh tauv wa Tôt-bu-li stâyz phangz. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Munh ênz ah lanh bah noomh đuungz cloon coong wac max byen nyăngz munh taih phunz Zâu Yê-su, stiz songđ joođ Zâu Yê-su tăpx puf ănz wax tauh munh. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Zâu Yê-su cănh ênz wax tauh munh ninyh lanyc gâyh songx munh, Zâu Yê-su songđ zob Nănh wax đomc bah đoz ănz wax tauh munh iz lepb bah noomh cotb, zef năngx nzuv nzanh taih hâuh ănz wax tauh munh nyăngz byetc. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Zâu Yê-su songđ zaub minb mangc staox guungh ninyh, tongb siv đao, songđ coong ănz wax tauh munh: “Ê-pha-ta,” (âyx gâyf six: “Coib goib gôh!”). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Tăng wa wax tauh munh nyăngz bah noomh songđ tuz coib goib, nănh nyăngz byetc yâuc tuz zany gongx, nănh songđ hayh coong tuz wac byen. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Zâu Yê-su cangđ stiz max phunz stiz lănv bux mănv. Six Nănh cun cangđ stiz, stiz zef cun lănv wax đomc wac năngx đuungx têx. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Munh senz numđ nyâyh ganc nzongf, stiz coong: “Tauh munh ayx nyăngz muif huungđ senz gongx nzongf. Nănh lôx năngx hayh ayx tuz bah noomh đuungz nyăngz munh mungv tuz numđ cloon mayv coong wac nyăngz munh yâuc hayh coong.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Yămz wax đomc noib, zef naih ah peob songx munh hongđ nzongf, max naih laiv luungđ nongc nhlinc, Zâu Yê-su songđ êu Nănh wax đomc stayb sây taih, yâuc coong bux stiz: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Yaz numđ hâuđ lênh nâyx đomc songx munh nzongf, wâyc stiz taih cloon Yaz yămz tuz pôz noib nzof bix lauf max zeengx naih luungđ nongc nhlinc tiny. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Năngđ coong Yaz phunz stiz nyâuđ sab phunb đangz muf pyau, stiz muf bah đamx jau six hayh yămh, wâyc stiz naih ah phanx munh tăng côz nzongf nyăngz tinc taih.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây songđ tauz Nănh coong: “Yămz nây stâyz phangz blănf, naih mănv hayh tăng laiv tix zoz nzu taih phunz nâyx đomc songx munh nhlinc heh?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Zâu Yê-su naic stiz: “Nyâuh naih sax nomz nzu heh?” Stiz tauz: “Nhlic nomz.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Zâu Yê-su songđ êu songx munh stâyv nzac nib ninyh, Nănh songđ zoz wa nhlic nomz nzu taih, sâuf hâuđ, songđ watz jaoz phunz Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nzâyz ninyh patz phunz songx munh, năngđ nâyx stayb sây buz songđ nzâyz ninyh patz phunz songx munh. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Stayb sây buz năngx naih tix cay byauf jenz, Zâu Yê-su sâuf hâuđ wax đomc byauf tuz, Nănh songđ êu stayb sây buz nzâyz nâyx đomc byauf ninyh patz timb. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Songx munh tuz nhlinc pêu nzuf, stayb sây buz yâuc sâub nhlinc yăngc wax đomc nzu tuz nhlic đanz. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Wax zanyf, cox naih pyâyz tinb munh, Zâu Yê-su songđ phunz songx munh muf. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Zâu Yê-su songđ Lênh dlih cloon stayb sây buz, nzac đangđ ninyh, Nănh ninyh tauv Đan-ma-nu-ta stâyz phangz.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Wax đomc Pha-li-si munh songđ nzac taih cloon Zâu Yê-su quef coonz tinyh nzeengz gâyf, stiz oix stâyv Nănh, songđ joođ Nănh ayx ah cuib njic hoouđ tăng guungh taih. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nyâyh conv tongb siv đao yămz nyâuđ, Nănh tauz: “Săngh laiv nâyx stâyv munh bix lov njic hoouđ? Yaz senz coong bux nyâuh, six max naih laiv huungđ njic hoouđ phunz nâyx stâyv munh phătc …” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Gâyh stiz blătc, Nănh zef lauf wa đangđ, quaix wax nganđ leepz coiđ sinh ninyh.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Stayb sây buz nyâuđ cob max nzâyz nzu lêpc, stiz yămz wa đangđ songđ max naih laiv luungđ tiny, cungb naih ah nomz nzu cuungv. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz coong: “Oix zuc stêu stimz! Bôngh Pha-li-si munh nyăngz piny cloon Hê-lôtx Huungh nyăngz piny.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Stayb sây buz lanh coong ănz lanh, Nănh coong năngđ nâyx six wâyc stiz max naih nzu. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Wâyc pâyz năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz stiz: “Săngh laix nyâuh bix lanh coong ănz lanh wâyc nyâuh max naih nzu? Nyâuh yâuc max zeengx manyh pec, max pyac nyâuđ haz? Săngx đanyf nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ nhlengc nzof stah? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Nyâuh naih mâyc lauf mangc max phătc haz? Naih bah noomh nyâuh lauf max numđ haz? Nyâuh lauf max săngx haz? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Yaz watz pyaz nomz nzu phunz pyaz tinb munh nhlinc wax zanyf, nyâuh sâub wax đomc nzu yăngc tuz sax đanz pong?” Nănh stiz tauz Zâu Yê-su: “săpc nyâyc đanz.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Năngx naih wa nhlic nomz nzu phunz pyâyz tinb munh nhlinc, nyâuh sâub wax đomc nzu yăngc tuz sax đanz pong?” Nănh stiz tauz Zâu Yê-su: “Nhlic đanz.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Zâu Yê-su zef naic stiz: “Ayx năngđ laix nyâuh cah nav lauf max manyh pec?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Stiz ninyh tauv Bêtx-sai-đa, naih munh ênz ah lanh mâyc buc munh taih phunz Zâu Yê-su, stiz songđ joođ Zâu Yê-su êu Nănh lumz wax tauh munh. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Zâu Yê-su nzauf mâyc buc munh nyăngz puf, jinb nănh setb njăngv sinh ninyh. Nzuf nzanh hâuh ănz nănh nyăngz mâyc, zef tăpx puf ănz nănh, Zâu Yê-su naic nănh: “Mâyh phătc tix huungđ max?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Nănh zaub minb mangc, yâuc tauz: “Yaz phătc munh stiz six cayx năngđ njăngx nâyx yăngh ninyh.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Zef năngx naih ah hâyđ timb, Zâu Yê-su tăpx puf ănz nănh nyăngz mâyc, nănh nzac jab mangc, nănh nyăngz mâyc songđ tuz zany gongx yâuc mangc tuz muif huungđ yox nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Zâu Yê-su êu nănh muf pyau, zef zăpx nănh: “Năngx gâyf nzac njăngv muf bex.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Zâu Yê-su cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây ninyh nzac Si-sa-li-ya Phi-lipx-poi dlanyh nyăngz njăngv, ninyh jau wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su naic Nănh wax đomc stayb sây, coong: “Munh coong Yaz six mănv?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Stiz songđ tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Quaix-gâyf wax tauh Yô-hanx, ah phanx coong ‘Ê-li-ya,’ zef năngx naih ah phanx coong: ‘Ah lanh wax đomc tâuc wac munh.’” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Zâu Yê-su naic stiz: “Ha nyâuh coong Yaz six mănv?” Tauz wax zanyf, Pi-tê songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh six Njâuv Zâu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Zâu Yê-su songđ zăpx bux stiz êu stiz max tuz lănv coong Nănh six mănv.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Zâu Yê-su songđ quef coonz nzaox nănh stiz coong Bamh Munh six zuc tanyđ đuungx huungđ zâuđ, zuc wax đomc munh côx cloon wax đomc stayb munh pyây cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf nyăngz stênx stengb nzêmh, yâuc zuc tayx tayc, tauv tah stamz noib năngx săngh taih. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Nănh coong nâyx đomc dlayc manyh pec nzuf. Pi-tê, songđ ênz Zâu Yê-su ninyh lanyc, songđ coong Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Six, Zâu Yê-su songđ winb đangz mangc Nănh wax đomc stayb sây, songđ mađ Pi-tê coong: “Sax-tanx lex, oix zuc toiv nzac yaz cah đangz muf! Wâyc mâyh max nongc mâyh nyăngz nyâuđ nyâyh tauv Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cumh pâuz, six cungb nyâyh bamh munh nyăngz cumh pâuz cuungv.” <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Zâu Yê-su songđ êu songx munh cloon Nănh nyăngz stayb sây taih dlonf, songđ coong ănz stiz: “Năngđ coong laiv lanh oix lêpc Yaz cah đangz, wax tauh munh six zuc cănh quanyf nănh nyăngz stinb, đamz nănh nyăngz săpc đăngc zax bix lêpc yaz. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh oix njâuv nănh nyăngz meengc, six zuc stâyb meengc, năngx naih laiv lanh wâyc Yaz cloon Yaz nyăngz Cuđ Jenx zuc tayc meengc, wax tauh six njâuv tuz nănh nyăngz meengc. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Năngđ coong ah lanh munh tuz nzuf guungh đi nyăngz muif huungđ, bix stâyb nănh nyăngz meengc hoonh, six naih luungđ gongx heh? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Wax tauh munh laiv zoz luungđ wănc nănh nyăngz meengc hoonh? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh numđ nyayz yaz cloon yaz nzaox nyăngz wac, yămz nâyx stâyv pongz lauh cloon stoif nyăngz tinc, Bamh Munh cloon wax đomc stinz munh đăngb, yămz Nănh nyăngz Pha nyăngz gwăngz eeng hinđ setb wax zany, lauf numđ nyayz wax tauh.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, nâyx đomc munh stâuđ nây, naih ah phanx munh max zeengx tayc six tuz phătc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz naih lanyf naih jab nzac taih.” <verse eid="MRK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Quaix đangz joz noib, Zâu Yê-su ênz Pi-tê, Ya-coopc cloon Yô-hanx yenv stiz staox ah nomz zoongz njăngb ninyh lanyc yămz wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ yămz stiz nyăngz cah đangc wav jangx. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Nănh nyăngz guyz songđ phangb pec, pec nzomz, ayx tuz yămz nây bamh canz max naih laiv tauh đuv guyz stangc bix hayh ayx tuz pec năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Stiz mangc phătc Ê-li-ya cloon Mô-sê iz lanh yămz wa cloon Zâu Yê-su coong wac. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pi-tê songđ goib nzetx bux Zâu Yê-su coong: “Stayb pha lex, pănh yămz nây senz gongx nzongf, buz ayx pôz sênz njiuh, ah sênz phunz Mâyh, ah sênz phunz Mô-sê ah sênz zef phunz Ê-li-ya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Wâyc Pi-tê max pâyz nănh cayx goib nzetx coong luungđ, wâyc stiz numđ cumh nzav nzongf.) <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Songđ naih ah tungđ vănx taih sêmz stiz, naih stingb tăng wax tungđ vănx setb taih coong: “Nây six Yaz stăngz nyăngz Toonz. Oix zuc mungv Nănh nyăngz wac.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Max bôngh nyâyh, stayb sây buz mangc wa cah sinh, max phătc laiv lanh cloon stiz yămz, cungb phătc Zâu Yê-su ah lanh cuungv.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Stiz tăng zoongz nzac taih wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su zăpx stiz coong êu stiz năngx gâyf lănv bux mănv stiz phătc nyăngz dlayc, năngđ coong max zeengx tauv săngx huđ Bamh Munh tăng tayc săngh taih. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Stiz pinyx nâyx đomc wac yămz stiz cah njaf, lanh naic lanh “tăng tayc săngh taih” six ayx laix. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Stiz songđ naic Zâu Yê-su coong: “Săngh laix wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx stengb bix coong Ê-li-ya six zuc taih đangc?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz stiz coong: “Ê-li-ya six senz taih đangc nongc zany muif huungđ dlayc. Ha naih wac ja coong Bamh Munh Nănh six zuc tanyđ đuungx huungđ zâuđ nanc zef zuc munh nzêmh six ayx laix? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Six, Yaz coong bux nyâuh Ê-li-ya senz taih nzof gôh, munh yâuc âyz stiz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ ayx sax huungđ ănz nănh, cayx năngđ naih wac ja tauv nănh coong nâyx.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Lauf tauv wax đomc stayb sây buz wa, stiz phătc ah peob songx munh hongđ nzongf wâyh nzêux stiz zef naih wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb cloon wax đomc stayb sây yămz wa nzeengz gâyf. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ah phătc, Zâu Yê-su wax zanyf, songx munh tinyh đoih numđ nyâyc ganc, stiz songđ coonx tiuv nzac taih stipx Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Zâu Yê-su naic wax đomc stayb sây: “Nyâuh jinh đangh cloon stiz nzeengz laiv huungđ heh?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Yămz songx munh mungh tongx naih ah lanh munh tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Stênx stengb lex, yaz ênz yaz nyăngz ah lanh toonz taih phunz mâyh, nănh zuc ah tauh mayv coong wac nyăngz manđ nzac yămz stinb. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Toix laiv hâyđ manđ nzac yaz sây nyăngz stinb, manđ songđ njitc tauh sây glinyf nzac, tauh sây yâuc nzanh byaof setb, tăpc nyah, zef puf staux nhlengc, yaz joođ mâyh nyăngz stayb sây luiđ manđ setb, six stiz luiđ max tuz.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Tauz stiz wax zanyf, Nănh coong: “Nâyx stâyv max zen nyăngz munh lex, yaz six zuc cloon nyâuh yămz tauv laiv zanyf heh? Yaz cayx zuc tanyđ nyâuh tauv laiv zanyf? Ênz tauh sây taih phunz yaz.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Stiz songđ ênz wax tauh toonz taih phunz Zâu Yê-su, phătc Zâu Yê-su wax zanyf, manđ songđ toongx sangf ayx wax tauh toonz sinx bătx bătx têx, glinyf nzac nib ninyh, nănh clingx quaix ninyh quaix lauf, yâuc naih nzanh byaof setb. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Zâu Yê-su naic wax tauh toonz nyăngz pha: “Nănh zuc năngđ nâyx bah laiv lauh nzof heh?” Wax tauh pha tauz: “Tăng wa năngx jenz. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Đuungx hâyđ manđ quanyf nănh, ah zanyf nzac tâuf, ah zanyf nzac womz, oix hoiđ nâyx tauh sây, six năngđ coong mâyh hayh ayx tuz tix huungđ, joođ mâyh hâuh lênh buz, stăngc buz.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “‘Năngđ coong mâyh hayh’ naz? Laiv lanh zen muif huungđ six tuz nzuf.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Wax tauh toonz nyăngz pha lênh dlih hamv tauz coong: “Yaz zen lêc! Joođ mâyh stăngc yaz hayh zen tuz tingc!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Phătc songx munh jinh đangh tiuv taih stiz wa, Zâu Yê-su mađ manđ yootz, êu manđ coong: “Bah noomh đuungz cloon mayv coong wac nyăngz manđ lex, Yaz setb lanyf phunz mâyh zuc setb nâyx tauh toonz ninyh tăng nây staox ninyh six max tuz nzac nănh nyăngz stinb lauf.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Manđ songđ hamv ngatz ngatz têx zef ayx wax tauh toonz sinx bătx bătx têx, manđ setb ninyh blătc, wax tauh sây songđ năngđ munh tayc nâyx, ayx tuz munh đuungx coong: “Tauh sây tayc nzof gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Six Zâu Yê-su nzauf wax tauh toonz nyăngz puf, njăpc nănh staox taih, wax tauh toonz songđ nyoongz quef. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Tauv Zâu Yê-su nzac wa pyau muf, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây cănh lanyc naic Nănh coong: “Săngh laix buz bix max luiđ tuz wax tauh manđ setb?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz: “Nâyx huungđ manđ, năngđ coong max cloo Zâu cloon njif nhlinc six max naih mănv hayh luiđ tuz.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Tăng wax cuyb tinc gâyh ninyh, stiz clăngv quaix Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, six Zâu Yê-su max oix nongc mănv pâyz, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />wâyc Zâu Yê-su jinh đangh nzaox Nănh nyăngz stayb sây, yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Bamh Munh cayx zuc jaoz phunz munh, stiz six tayx Nănh tayc. Tauv munh tayx tayc blătc, pôz noib cah đangz Nănh six năngx săngh taih.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Six stayb sây buz max saz nâyx zâux wac, yâuc cumh nzav max nzađ naic Zâu Yê-su.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Stiz ninyh tauv Ca-bê-na-um dlanyh, nzac pyau cah njaf ninyh, Zâu Yê-su songđ naic wax đomc stayb sây: “Jămc jau taih wax zanyf nyâuh lanh coong ănz lanh luungđ heh?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Six stiz max nyaoc tiny, wâyc jămc jau taih wax zanyf stiz tinyh zenđ mangc jađ mănv ayx năngx lub quaix. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Zâu Yê-su stâyv nzac, songđ êu wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây taih dlonf wa yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Năngđ coong mănv oix ayx lub, wax tauh munh six zuc ayx năngx jenz quaix muif lanh yâuc ayx songx munh nyăngz pâuz.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Sên zoz ah munh sây taih: Zâu Yê-su phunz wax tauh sây yămz stayb sây buz wa mungh tongx Nănh zef jom wax tauh sây ănz Nănh nyăngz puf, songđ coong bux stiz: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Laiv lanh tim yaz nyăngz manyh stipx ah lanh munh sây năngđ nâyx lanh sây nâyx wax tauh munh six stipx yaz, năngđ coong laiv lanh stipx yaz, wax tauh max zâyf cungb stipx Yaz cuungv, six lauf stipx paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh.” <verse eid="MRK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yô-hanx coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Stênx stengb lex, buz phătc naih ah lanh munh tim mâyh nyăngz manyh luiđ manđ buz bix cangđ wax tauh munh, wâyc nănh max lêpc pănh.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Six Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Năngx gâyf cangđ nănh, wâyc max naih laiv lanh munh tim yaz nyăngz manyh ayx jix caox njingc blătc wa quaix đangz zef năngx coong peo yaz. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Wâyc laiv lanh max cloon pănh tinyh tămx wax lanh six cloon pănh tinyh hoođ. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Wâyc laiv lanh tim yaz nyăngz manyh phunz ah zan womz nyâuh wâyc nyâuh six Jix-Tuz nyăngz munh, yaz coong senz bux nyâuh wax tauh munh nyăngz phănc senz max stâyb. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Năngx naih laiv lanh ayx phunz ah lanh zen yaz nâyx đomc munh sây jenz pamf stoif, năngđ coong điux ah nomz njăuz mac lub ănz nănh nyăngz clangz, quanyf nănh nzac coiđ ninyh six năngx gongx têx. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Năngđ coong nyâuh nyăngz puf hayh ayx phunz nyâuh zuc longđ stoif, oix zuc cumv ayx queengx, Nyâuh stoc ah saz puf bix tuz stâyv quâyx meengc six năngx gongx têx, naih iz saz puf bix zuc nzac yămz stâyv quâyx max hayh tayc nyăngz tâuf coiđ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />(yămz wa jengz stăyv max hayh tayc, tâuf yâuc stâyv quâyx max tayc). <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Năngđ coong nyâuh nyăngz staux hayh ayx phunz nyâuh longđ stoif, oix zuc cumv ayx queengx. Nyâuh stoc ah saz staux bix tuz stâyv quâyx meengc six năngx gongx têx, naih iz saz staux bix zuc quanyf nzac tâuf coiđ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />(yămz wa jengz stăyv max hayh tayc, tâuf yâuc stâyv quâyx max tayc). <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Năngđ coong nyâuh nyăngz mâyc hayh ayx phunz nyâuh longđ stoif, oix zuc ngwai ayx queengx. Nyâuh stoc ah nomz mâyc bix tuz nzac Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz, six năngx gongx têx naih iz nomz mâyc bix zuc quanyf nzac tâuf coiđ, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />yămz wa jengz stăyv max hayh tayc, tâuf yâuc stâyv quâyx max tayc. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Wâyc muif lanh six zuc nongc tâuf ipx. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Đau six gongx, six coong đau max camz, nyâuh cayx zoz luungđ ayx tuz đau đaih heh? Nyâuh zuc naih đau yămz nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ, lanh yâuc oix zuc cloon lanh hoopđ stimz songc âyx yămz.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Zâu Yê-su songđ nyoongz quef tăng wax cuib tinc ninyh tauv Yu-đê stâyz phangz cloon Njoh-đen wăngx wax leepz nib tâyc, songx munh zef tinyh ênz taih tauv Zâu Yê-su wa. Zâu Yê-su zef nzaox stiz cayx năngđ Nănh stâyv quâyx ayx nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Wax đomc Pha-li-si munh taih tauv stătx, stiz oix stâyv Zâu Yê-su songđ naic Nănh coong gâyf njanh phunz ah lanh langh queengx au max. <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Six, Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Ha Mô-sê nzaox nyâuh ayx laix?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Stiz tauz: “Mô-sê phunz langh ja gâyh stayb stâub songđ phunz au setb ninyh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Six wâyc nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ nhlengc, nănh nzăngđ ja nâyx tiuh gâyf phunz nyâuh. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Six, tăng săngđ coonz zuyx guungh zuyx nib,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 10:6">‘Zâu Tênb-Huungh cungb zuyx stiz, ah lanh toonz cloon ah lanh sab cuungv.’<verse eid="MRK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Wâyc năngđ nâyx, munh toonz six zuc gâyh nănh nyăngz nzif pha,<verse eid="MRK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />stiz iz lanh six săngh ah nomz stinb.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 10:8" />
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 10:8">Wâyc nây, stiz max zâyf iz nomz stinb six cungb ah nomz stinb cuungv. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, Zâu Tênb-Huungh căpx taih nyăngz munh, bamh munh six max tuz zeb gâyh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Yămz wa pyau njaf wax zanyf, stayb sây buz zef naic Zâu Yê-su nâyx đomc jau. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Zâu Yê-su coong bux stiz: “laiv lanh queengx nănh nyăngz au bix zef zoz pitc lanh munh, wax tauh munh songđ longđ văngf munh nyăngz stoif cloon nănh nyăngz au. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Năngđ coong munh nzif, queengx nănh nyăngz langh, zoz pitc lanh munh, nănh songđ zuc longđ văngf munh nyăngz stoif.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Naih munh ênz wax đomc munh sây jenz taih phunz Zâu Yê-su oix nongc Nănh tăpx puf ănz stiz, six stayb sây buz yâuc cangđ wax đomc munh. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Six, phătc năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su numđ nhlenx nzongf songđ coong ănz stiz: “Phanv phunz munh sây taih yaz nây, yâuc năngx gâyf cangđ stiz, wâyc laiv lanh năngđ nâyx đomc munh sây nâyx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz six săngh stiz nyăngz. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh max stipx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz năngđ ah lanh munh sây jenz nâyx, wax tauh munh six senz max tuz nzac yămz wa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Zâu Yê-su songđ jom wax đomc munh sây, tăpx puf ănz stiz, Nănh yâuc poou wac phunz.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Zâu Yê-su ah yac setb jau ninyh wax zanyf, naih ah lanh munh tiuv taih, songđ quâyc nzac Nănh nyăngz cah đangc ninyh, wax tauh munh naic Zâu Yê-su: “Peengh stimz nyăngz stênx steengb lex, yaz zuc ayx năngđ laix yaz nzăngđ hayh tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz meengc?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Six Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Săngh laix mâyh bix hipđ yaz ayx peengh stimz heh? Setb nzuf Zâu Tênb-Huungh ah lanh max naih mănv peengh stimz. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Mâyh pâyz wax đomc gâyf njanh coong: ‘Năngx gâyf tayx munh, Năngx gâyf văngf munh, năngx gâyf ayx stac, năngx gâyf ayx za zanyx manyf, năngx gâyf nyâuđ huđ jaf munh, oix zuc hâuđ lênh mâyh nyăngz nzif pha.’” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Six wax tauh munh tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Stênx stengb lex, tăng yaz năngx jenz yaz bâyf ayx âyz nâyx đomc muif huungh gâyf nzuf nzof gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Six mangc nănh wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su numđ hâuđ lênh nănh, yâuc bux nănh coong: “Mâyh năngx sămv ah huungđ; oix zuc muf, maic mâyh naih nyăngz muif huungđ, bix ninyh phunz munh zâuđ, mâyh six naih jax dlaih yămz wa Tênb-toongh, bix oix zuc taih nây, lêpc yaz.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Six numđ nâyx đomc wac wax tauh munh songđ minb âuz âuz, numđ stauh taux wa muf, wâyc nănh naih jax toongx đuungx nzongf.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Zâu Yê-su winb mangc wa cah sinh, songđ coong ănz Nănh wax đomc stayb sây: “Naih jax toongx đuungx nyăngz munh nzac Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz senz Zâuđ nzongf!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Stayb sây buz numđ nyâyh ganc Zâu Yê-su coong nyăngz wac nzongf, six Zâu Yê-su zef coong ănz stiz, ah hâyđ timb coong: “Sây lex, tuz nzac Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz senz zâuđ nzongf! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Maf loh plunx quaix stimb bluyc, six năngx hâyđ têx puv quâyx munh nzac Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Stayb sây buz senz numđ njingc nzongf, songđ coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Năngđ nâyx naih mănv hayh tuz njâuv?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Mangc stiz, Zâu Yê-su coong: “Laiv huungđ bamh munh ayx max tuz, six max zâyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh. Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh hayh ayx tuz muif huungđ nzuf.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Pi-tê songđ tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Stayb pha mangc jađ, buz quanyf nzuf muif huungđ bix taih lêpc mâyh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, max naih mănv quanyf pyau, Yâuf pez, ô stayx, nzif pha, sây, nib tâyc wâyc yaz cloon Cuđ Jenx, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />bix max tuz stipx blătc ah pez phănc yămz nâyx zanyf nâyx stâyv: njinh pyau, yâuf pez, ô stayx, nzif, sây, njingh tâyc cloon zuc munh ayx huđ, cloon đangz stâyv nyăngz stâyv quâyx meengc. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Six naih munh đuungx yămz cah đangc six zuc yămz cah đangz, zef yămz cah đangz nyăngz munh six tuz yămz cah đangc.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Stiz jinh đangh jămc jau ninyh Yê-lu-sa-lem wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su ninyh đangc stiz. Stayb sây buz numđ nyâyh njanc nzongf, năngx naih lêpc stiz đangz ninyh wax đomc munh yâuc numđ cumh nzav. Ênz săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây ninyh lanyc blătc, Nănh songđ coong bux stiz Nănh cayx zuc pongh nyăngz dlayc, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />coong: “Mangc bex, pănh jinh đangh ninyh tauv Yê-lu-sa-lem, Bamh Munh six zuc jaoz phunz wax đomc stayb munh pyây cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf nyăngz stênx stengb, stiz six tingc stoif tayx Nănh zef jaoz Nănh phunz đâuf. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Stiz six pib mađ Nănh, nzuf nzanh ănz Nănh, zoz pya bopc Nănh, zef tayx Nănh, six pôz noib cah đangz Nănh six săngh taih.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Sê-bê-đi nyăngz iz lanh toonz Ya-coopc cloon Yô-hanx, taih pongh Zâu Yê-su, songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Stayb pha lex, buz oix nongc buz joođ mâyh toix laiv huungđ mâyh lauf ayx phunz buz.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz stiz coong: “Nyâuh oix nongc yaz ayx laix phunz nyâuh?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Tăng wa stiz songđ tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Joođ phunz buz hayh stâyv yămz mâyh nyăngz gwăngz eeng tinc, ah lanh stâyv mâyh nyăngz byaoh phanx ah lanh stâyv mâyh nyăngz staix phanx.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Six Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Nyâuh max pâyz nyâuh jinh đangh joođ laiv huungđ. Nyâuh hayh hopb tuz yaz hopb wax zan, max six ayx quaix-gâyf năngđ yaz ayx quaix-gâyf nâyx max?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Stiz tauz Zâu Yê-su: “Tuz lêc.” Zâu Yê-su zef coong ănz stiz: “Yaz hopb wax zan, nyâuh lauf zuc hopb, yaz ayx quaix-gâyf, nyâuh lauf zuc ayx. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Six stâyv yămz yaz nyăngz byaoh phanx max six staix phanx max zâyf yaz bênc phunz, six njâuh phunz bênc săngh nyăngz munh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Wa săpc lanh stayb sây numđ nâyx đomc wac songđ numđ nhlenx Ya-coopc cloon Yô-hanx nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Zâu Yê-su êu stiz taih, songđ coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh pâyz tuz coong pitc stingx nyăngz munh tuz bongc cun pec stingx wax đomc, six njic pec stingx, cloon stiz wax đomc ayx quanz lub nyăngz munh yâuc nongc lanyf zâyc nyenh mănh. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Yămz nyâuh nyăngz cah njaf six max zâyf ayx năngđ nâyx. Laiv lanh oix tuz ayx lub yămz nyâuh nyăngz cah njaf wax tauh six zuc bokc dlic nyâuh, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />yămz nyâuh nyăngz cah njaf laiv lanh oix ayx pyây six zuc ayx nâuh phunz songx munh. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Wâyc Bamh munh taih six max zâyf nongc phunz munh bokc dlic, six nongc bokc dlic munh yâuc sađ Nănh nyăngz meengc nongc ayx zax suc tayv phunz đuungx lanh munh.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Stiz nzac Yê-li-cô dlanyh ninyh, Zâu Yê-su zef cloon Nănh nyăngz stayb sây cloon munh đuungx tăng Yê-li-cô ninyh gâyh wax zanyf, naih ah lanh mâyc buđ munh Ba-ti-mê-atc six Ti-mê-atc nyăngz toonz, stâyv yămz wa jau sinh joođ nhlinc. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Wâyc pâyz tuz coong wax tauh six Na-sa-leetx munh Zâu Yê-su, nănh songđ hamv coong: “Đa-witx huungh nyăngz Toonz, Zâu Yê-su lex, joođ hâuđ lênh yaz!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Munh đuungx mađ nâyx lanh munh êu nănh năngx gâyf nhlaoc, six nănh zef hamv năngx lub têx: “Đa-witx huungh nyăngz sây lex, joođ hâuđ lênh yaz!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Zâu Yê-su songđ yămf wa, coong: “Phanv êu nănh taih.” Stiz songđ êu wax tauh mâyc buđ munh, bux nănh coong: “Phanv pungx stimz bex! Nyoongz quef gôh! Stênx stengb êu mâyh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Songđ quanyf nănh nyăngz guyz đao ănz ah phanx, totc têx nyoongz quef, nănh ninyh tauv Zâu Yê-su wa. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz nănh coong: “Mâyh oix nongc yaz ayx laix phunz mâyh?” Tăng wa mâyc buđ munh songđ tauz Nănh coong: “La-bi, joođ phunz yaz mangc tuz phătc.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Năngđ nâyx Zâu Yê-su bux nănh coong: “Phanv ninyh gôh. Mâyh nyăngz zen stimz cănh zany mâyh tuz gongx.” Nănh songđ lênh dlih mangc tuz phătc, nănh songđ lêpc Zâu Yê-su jămc jau ninyh.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Stiz ninyh tauv stătx Yê-lu-sa-lem, tauv Bêtc-pha-yi cloon Bê-ta-ni, huungv ninyh wa Ca-lan zoongz, Zâu Yê-su songđ paiđ Nănh nyăngz iz lanh stayb sây ninyh, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />songđ bux stiz coong: “Oix zuc ninyh nzac nyâuh cah đangc wax tiuh njăngv, ninyh tauv wa wax zanyf, nyâuh six phătc ah tauh maf li jenz pang ănz wa, Max zeengx naih mănv zâyh nănh quaix. Phanv zay pang nănh wax stinz langb bix jinb nănh lauf nây. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Năngđ coong naih munh naic nyâuh: ‘Săngh laix nyâuh bix ayx năngđ nâyx?’ six phanv tauz coong: ‘Zâu sămv zuc nongc nâyx tauh maf li Nănh six cănh stungx nâyx tauh maf li phunb đangz lauf.’” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Stiz gâyh ninyh songđ phătc ah tauh maf li jenz pang ănz wa jeengh cungh ngwaic wa jau sinh, stiz songđ zay langb phunz maf li. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Naih ah phanx munh stâuđ wa naic stiz coong: “Nyâuh iz lanh ayx luungđ bix zay maf li jenz langb heh?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Stiz zef tauz wax đomc munh năngđ Zâu Yê-su bux nâyx, wax đomc munh songđ phunz stiz jinb ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Stiz ênz maf li jenz lauf phunz Zâu Yê-su yâuc zoz stiz nyăngz guyz đao pâub ănz maf li jenz cah tănf, Zâu Yê-su songđ staox ninyh zâyh. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Naih munh đuungx pâub stiz nyăngz guyz ănz wa jau, năngx naih ah phanx, zef pâub wax đomc njăngx quah tăng wa jêmh zoz lauf. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Njinh wax đomc munh ninyh đangc cloon lêpc đangz wax đomc munh hamv coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hô-sa-na! Hoopđ zuc canyx bongc tim Zâu nyăngz manyh taih wax tauh.<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Senz oonz looc pănh nyăngz claof jex Đa-witx huungh nyăngz côkz six taih!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Hô-sa-na yămz njăngb quaix nyăngz tinc!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Zâu Yê-su ninyh tauv Yê-lu-sa-lem dlanyh, yâuc nzac bongc Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau ninyh, mangc nzêux cah sinh nyăngz muif huungđ, wâyc wax zanyf six nzămc nzof, Nănh cloon săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây setb ninyh tauv Bê-ta-ni njăngv. <verse eid="MRK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nyâyc noib, Stiz ninyh gâyh Bê-ta-ni njăngv wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su songđ nyâuđ sab. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Tăng năngx yămz côz wax zanyf Nănh phătc ah zâyz bănx tauh njăngx naih noomh đuungx, Nănh ninyh tauv stătx lov jađ tuz phătc naih tix nomz pyâu yămz wa njăngx max. Six ninyh tauv wax zâyz njăngx wax zanyf, Nănh max phătc naih luungđ cungb naih noomh cuungv, wâyc max zeengx tauv bănx tauh zunb. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz wax zâyz njăngx: “Tăng nây staox ninyh six max naih mănv nhlinc mâyh nyăngz pyâu nzof gôh.” Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayb sây yâuc numđ nâyx đomc wac.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ninyh tauv Yê-lu-sa-lem wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su nzac bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau ninyh, songđ luiđ maif maic yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau wax đomc munh setb cungh ngwaic ninyh, Nănh zef njăpc wănc nyanh wax đomc munh nyăngz đah mâyf cloon maic bah côz wax đomc munh nyăngz zom, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Nănh max phunz toix laiv lanh nzâyz huv clăngv quaix bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su nzaox stiz coong: “Max zâyf naih wac ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">‘Yaz nyăngz pyau six hipđ ayx cloo Zâu phunz muif stingx munh nyăngz pyau’ haz?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Six nyâuh ayx nâyx sênz pyau pênx ayx stac munh nyăngz ngamh.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Wax đomc stayb munh pyây cloon nzaox gâyf stênx stengb numđ năngđ nâyx, stiz songđ lov jau nongc tayx Zâu Yê-su, wâyc stiz cumh nzav Nănh, wâyc songx munh tinyh đoih numđ nyâyc ganc Nănh nzaox nyăngz wac. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Tauv nzămc wax zanyf, stiz ninyh gâyh wa dlanyh.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Bah đoomz tonx njâu, pitb quaix wa ninyh, stiz phătc bănx tauh njăngx caođ tăng coonz tauv đuungh. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pi-tê săngx tauv songđ coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “La-bi, mangc geh! Mâyh zaux lâyc zâyz bănx tauh njăngx njeengh caođ nzof.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz zef bux coong: “Oix zuc naih zen stimz yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh coong ănz nâyx nomz zoongz coong: ‘Oix zuc moongz staox taih bix stuyđ nzac coiđ ninyh,’ yămz nănh nyăngz nyâuđ max naih plungh plănb, six zen coong nănh coong nyăngz wac six setb taih, songđ setb taih năngđ nănh coong nyăngz wac nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, yaz coong bux nyâuh, nyâuh cloo Zâu cloon joođ nyăngz muif huungđ, phanv zen coong nyâuh stipx tuz nzof, wax huungđ nyâuh senz stipx tuz gôh. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Nyâuh stâuđ cloo Zâu wax zanyf, năngđ coong nyâuh naih cloon munh tinyh nzeengz, six oix zuc quanyf, nyâuh nyăngz Tênb-toongh Pha yămz wa cah zâyc guungh wax Tauh nzăngđ quanyf phunz nyâuh ayx longđ nyăngz stoif.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />(Six năngđ coong nyâuh max quanyf phunz, nyâuh nyăngz Tênb-toongh Pha yămz wa cah zâyc guungh wax Tauh lauf max quanyf phunz nyâuh ayx longđ nyăngz stoif.)<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Stiz zef muf tauv wa Yê-lu-sa-lem Zâu Yê-su ninyh nzac bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau wax zanyf, wax đomc stayb munh pyây, cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx stengb, cloon wax đomc munh côx taih Zâu Yê-su wa. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Stiz coong ănz Nănh: “Wâyc laiv huungđ lokc jangx Mâyh bix ayx wax đomc dlayc max six mănv jaoz phunz Mâyh nâyx đomc lokc jangx Mâyh bix hayh ayx wax huungđ dlayc?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Six Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Ha yaz lauf naic nyâuh ah zâux, phanv tauz Yaz, yaz songđ coong bux nyâuh wâyc laiv huungđ lokc jangx yaz bix ayx wax đomc dlayc. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yô-hanx ayx nyăngz quaix-gâyf six tăng guungh max six tăng bamh munh? Phanv tauz yaz.” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Stiz lanh naic lanh coong: “(Pănh cayx coong ayx laix?) Pănh năngđ coong: ‘Tăng guungh’, Nănh six coong: ‘Ha, wâyc săngh laix nyâuh bix max zen Yô-hanx?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Six, pănh năngđ coong: ‘Tăng bamh munh,’ …?” (Nănh stiz cumh nzav songx munh, Wâyc muif lanh munh yâuc zen coong Yô-hanx six senz ah lanh tâuc wac munh.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Tauz Zâu Yê-su wax zanyf, stiz coong: “Buz max pâyz.” Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Ha yaz lauf max coong bux nyâuh tăng laiv huungđ lokc jangx yaz bix ayx wax đomc dlayc.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Zâu Yê-su quef coonz nongc wac pây coong ănz stiz: “Naih ah lanh munh songx tungh cuđ lauđ winb, wâyh nzêux nzuf, wêtz lung nongc ngatc ayx tiu, Zâyv ah nomz stapx jămđ, songđ phunz wax đomc songx tungh cuđ nyăngz munh tingc jămđ wax nomz lauđ winb, songđ setb jau ninyh côz. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Tauv stâub zunb nyăngz săngx huđ, lauđ winb zâu paiđ ah lanh cumh pâuz munh ninyh pongh wax đomc songx tungh cuđ nyăngz munh nongc huih nâyx đomc munh, nănh nzăngđ hayh tuz stipx ah phănc wa lauđ winb nyăngz nyanh gâyc. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Stiz songđ toopz wax tauh pâuz taih bopc, yâuc luiđ nănh pec puf phunb đangz muf. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Lauđ winb zâu zef paiđ pitc tauh cumh pâuz munh ninyh pongh stiz, six stiz yâuc bopc wax tauh pâuz nyăngz pyây yâuc mađ nănh. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Tăng wa lauđ winb zâu zef paiđ pitc lanh cumh pâuz munh ninyh timb, tauv wax tauh, nănh stiz tayx tayc, cloon đuungx lanh timb — lauh lanh six zuc bopc, lauh lanh six zuc tayx. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Lauđ winb zâu năngx naih ah lanh munh timb, six nănh stăngz nyăngz toonz, nănh paiđ wax lanh toonz ninyh, nzuf wax lanh munh, ninyh pongh nănh stiz, nyâyh coong: ‘Nănh stiz six nyangc nănh nyăngz toonz.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Six songx tungh cuđ nyăngz munh lanh coong ănz lanh: ‘Nây six stipx lauđ winb wax tauh. Ninyh gôh, pănh oix zuc tayx nănh, nănh stipx nyăngz jax toongx six săngh pănh nyăngz.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Năngđ nâyx nănh stiz zoz wax tauh sây tayx wax zanyf, songđ đănx nănh setb tungh cuđ lauđ winb cungh ngwaic ninyh quanyf. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Năngđ nâyx, tungh cuđ lauđ winb zâu six ayx laix? Nănh six taih tayx wax đomc songx tungh cuđ munh bix zef jaoz tungh cuđ lauđ winb phunz pitc tauh munh. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nyâuh max zeengx toc nâyx zâux wac yămz canyx stâub haz?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Ayx pyau stangc nzêmh wax nomz njăuz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">wax nomz njăuz six săngh pyau joongz nyăngz njăuz.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Nâyx đomc dlayc six tăng Zâu taih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">wax đomc dlayc yămz pănh nyăngz mâyc mangc senz njingc nzongf.’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Năngđ nâyx wâyc stiz pâyz coong Zâu Yê-su coong wax đomc wac pây six plaz ănz stiz, stiz songđ lov jau zoz Zâu Yê-su, six stiz yâuc cumh nzav songx munh. Gâyh Nănh wax zanyf, stiz songđ gâyh ninyh.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Stiz zef paiđ ah đomc Pha-li-si munh cloon Hê-lôtx wax peob munh taih pongh Zâu Yê-su nongc lov jau stiv phunz Nănh coong longđ. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Taih tauv wax zanyf, stiz coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Stênx stengb lex, buz pâyz tuz coong mâyh six nyâuđ zac nyăngz munh, yămz Mâyh six max naih laiv huungđ coong năngx pyac toix laiv lanh, wâyc Mâyh max zâyf cungb mangc munh nyăngz cungh ngwaic cuungv, six, Mâyh nzaox Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jau toix senz gâyf nzuf. Setb sôiv phunz Sê-sa toix gâyf max? Pănh hoopđ zuc setb six max setb?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Six Zâu Yê-su pâyz tuz stiz six pâyc zac nyâuđ yootz, songđ coong ănz stiz: “Săngh laix nyâuh bix stâyv yaz? Phanv zoz ah leepz nyanh taih phunz yaz mangc.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Năngđ nâyx stiz songđ nzâyz ah leepz nyanh taih, Zâu Yê-su songđ naic stiz coong: “Nây hanyh cloon bux six mănv nyăngz?” Stiz tauz Zâu Zâu Yê-su coong: “Sê-sa nyăngz.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su bux stiz coong: “Laiv huungđ six Sê-sa nyăngz oix zuc clao phunz Sê-sa, laiv huungđ six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz yâuc oix zuc clao phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh.” Stiz songđ numđ nyâyc ganc Zâu Yê-su nzongf.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Naih ah đomc Sa-đu-si munh, six wax đomc coong munh tayc max hayh săngh taih, taih pongh Zâu Yê-su zef naic Nănh coong: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Stênx steengb lex, Mô-sê ja phunz pănh coong: ‘Năngđ coong tix lanh nyăngz tah tayc nănh nyăngz au max zeengx naih sây, six wax tauh tah nyăngz yâuf zuc zoz wax tauh au nongc stipx tah nyăngz stu stongz.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Naih nhlic yâuf pez, tah coonz zoz au max zeengx naih sây bix tayc, <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />tah nyâyc lanh zoz wax tauh au, max zeengx naih sây lauf tayc, tah stamz lanh lauf năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Njinh wa nhlic lanh yâuf pez max naih sây tiny. Blătc quaix đangz, wax tauh munh nzif lauf tayc. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Tauv săngx huđ stiz săngh taih, wax tauh au six săngh mănv nyăngz? Wâyc wa nhlic lanh tinyh đoih zoz wax tauh munh nzif nongc ayx au nzuf.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz: “Max zâyf nyâuh zuc yenv ninyh longđ wâyc nâyx tiuh gâyf haz, wâyc max saz canyx stâub yâuc max pâyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz lokc jangx? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Wâyc munh tăng tayc săngh taih wax zanyf, munh six max tinyh zoz, stiz six năngđ stinz munh yămz wa guungh. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Năngx naih munh tuz tăng tayc săngh taih, nyâuh max zeengx toc quaix yămz Mô-sê nyăngz stâub, yămz wa nzim plungz, ayx laix Zâu Tênb-Huungh bix bux Mô-sê coong: ‘Yaz six Apx-la-ham nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh, I-sakx nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh, cloon Ya-côpx nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh’? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Nănh max zâyf munh tayc nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh, six munh săngh nyăngz. Nyâuh senz longđ lub nzongf gôh.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ah lanh wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb taih tauv stătx, numđ stiz jinh đangh nzeengz gâyf, phătc Zâu Yê-su tauz wax đomc munh senz toix nzongf, nănh songđ naic Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yetx stong gâyf njanh six laiv tiuh năngx nongc sen quaix?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Zâu Yê-su tauz coong: “Laiv tiuh gâyf njanh six năngx nongc sen quaix: ‘I-sa-la-ên munh lex, oix zuc mungv, Zâu, pănh nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh, six ah tau Zâu cuungv. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mâyh zuc nongc nzuf mâyh nyăngz nyâuđ, nongc nzuf mâyh nyăngz zux ix, nongc nzuf mâyh nyăngz tongb manyh, nongc nzuf mâyh nyăngz jab, stăngz Zâu six mâyh nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Tah nyâyc tiuh gâyf njanh six nây: ‘Mâyh zuc stăngz mâyh nyăngz cah sinh munh năngđ mâyh nyăngz stinb nâyx.’ Max naih laiv tiuh gâyf njanh năngx lub têx nây iz tiuh.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Nzaox gâyf stênx steengb tauz Nănh coong: “Toix gôh, stênx steengb lex! Mâyh coong senz toix gâyf, senz cungb naih ah tauh Zâu Tênb-Huungh cuungv, blătc nzuf Nănh max naih pitc tauh Zâu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Nongc nzuf nyâuđ, nongc nzuf tongb manyh cloon nongc nzuf jab stăngz Zâu, yâuc stăngz cah sinh munh năngđ stăngz cănh nyăngz stinb nâyx, ayx nâyx six năngx saix têx muif huungđ pu congx nyăngz tax huungđ cloon stanyb lanyh.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Zâu Yê-su phătc nănh tauz lemđ nzongf, songđ coong bux nănh: “Mâyh max gâyh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz côz đêh.” Tăng wa songđ max naih mănv nzađ naic Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau nzaox gâyf wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su naic coong: “Ayx năngđ laix wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb bix coong Zâu Jix-Tuz six Đa-witx huungh nyăngz sây? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Zâu Singx-Lingh, cănh phunz Đa-witx huungh coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Zâu coong ănz yaz nyăngz Zâu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Phanv stâyv Yaz nyăngz byaoh phanx,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">zu tauv laiv zanyf Yaz zoz Mâyh nyăngz yônz zaz ănz Mâyh nyăngz staux đi.”’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Đa-witx huungh cănh hipđ Nănh ayx ‘Zâu,’ ayx laix Nănh hayh săngh wax tauh huungh nyăngz sây?” Wax đomc songx munh numđ nyađ mungv Nănh nzaox.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yămz Nănh nzaox wax zanyf, Nănh coong: “Oix zuc bôngh wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb, wax đomc munh six cungb oix zuz guyz đao ninyh lauf, yămz wa caiz sangc yâuc oix nongc munh đeh, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />yămz huyđ toongh oix stâyv saix nyăngz tinc, nzac hinh yâuc oix stâyv wa hinh coonz. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wax đomc munh guutb au qua munh nyăngz pyau, cah đanyc cloo Zâu đao. Nâyx đomc munh six zuc tingc stoif năngx niđ têx.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Wax zanyf yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau Zâu Yê-su stâyv yămz wa pungx hoođ nyanh hoomh sinh, mangc songx munh pungx nyanh ănz hoomh năngđ laix. Naih đuungx lanh puf quâyx munh nzâyz nyanh đuungx taih pungx. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Naih ah tauh munh bôf qua zâuđ taih tauv, pungx iz nomz tongh stinh jenz, zax stinh six buc ah steenx. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Zâu Yê-su êu Nănh wax đomc stayb sây taih, songđ coong ănz stiz: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh nâyx lanh munh bôf qua zâuđ pungx hoođ năngx đuungx têx muif lanh pungx nyanh ănz hoomh nyăngz munh. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Wâyc stiz muif lanh pungx tăng stiz nyăngz nyanh đany, six nâyx lanh bôf, nănh senz zâuđ nzongf yâuc pungx nzuf nănh naih nyăngz, six njinh yuungf nănh nyăngz meengc nyanh.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Zâu Yê-su ninyh gâyh bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc ah lanh stayb sây coong ănz Nănh: “Stayb pha lex, phanv mangc! Lâyc đomc njăuz lub tuz nâyx cloon lâyc đomc pyau senz vâyc tuz nâyx!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Zâu Yê-su tauz wax lanh stayb sây coong: “Mâyh phătc lâyc đomc pyau lub max? Six max naih yăngc ah nomz njăuz clăpb ănz pitc nomz njăuz yămz lâyc bix max zuc bopc lakb.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Zâu Yê-su stâyv ca lan zoongz yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau toix nganc wax zanyf, Pi-tê, Ya-coopc, Yô-hanx cloon An-đa-lu lanyc naic Nănh: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Joođ stayb pha coong bux buz, laiv zanyf nâyx đomc dlayc nzăngđ setb taih? Yâuc naih laiv huungđ njic hoouđ setb tauv wax đomc muif huungđ dlayc cayx setb taih?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Wa zanyf, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz stiz: “Oix zuc cayb bôngh, năngx gâyf phunz mănv yenv nyâuh ninyh longđ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Đuungx lanh munh six taih tim yaz nyăngz manyh, coong: ‘Yaz six Jix-Tuz gôh,’ stiz songđ yenv munh đuungx ninyh longđ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Six laiv zanyf nyâuh numđ coong tauv naih panx peengz yâuc numđ panx peengz nyăngz jenx, six năngx gâyf cumh nzav; nâyx đomc dlayc six zuc setb taih, six lauf max zeengx zâyf setb mâyv noib. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Wâyc nâyx stingx six cloon wax stingx tinyh nzeengz, nâyx nomz côkz zef cloon wax nomz côkz tinyh nzeengz. Đuungx đoif tinc yâuc naih nib tongf, yâuc naih nyâuđ sab đuungx. Nâyx đomc dlayc six quef coonz setb năngđ munh nzif munz sây gumc nâyx.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Nyâuh six zuc năngx cayb bôngh. Munh six jaoz nyâuh phunz stămđ stoif quanz yâuc yămz huyđ toongh, nyâuh six zuc bopc, zuc stâuđ yămz naih lanyf nyăngz munh cloon huungh nyăngz cah đangc wâyc yaz, năngđ ah cuib zanyx manyf phunz stiz. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Tah yetx, Cuđ Jenx six zuc nzônh phunz muif stingx munh. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Stiz ênz nyâuh ninyh stămđ wax zanyf, năngx gâyf stauh nyâuh coong nyăngz wac. Six năngđ coong naih laiv zâux wac sađ phunz nyâuh yămz wax săngx huđ, phanv coong wax zâux wac; wâyc max zâyf nyâuh coong, six Zâu Singx-Lingh coong. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Tah six jaoz yâuf phunz munh tayx tayc, pha yâuc jaoz sây. Sây six cănh nzeengz nzif pha songđ ayx stiz zuc tayx tayc. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Wâyc yaz nyăngz manyh nyâuh six zuc muif lanh munh hănđ. Six laiv lanh tanyđ tuz tauv tauh tauv mâyv, wax lanh songđ tuz njâuv gôh.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Six, tauv nyâuh phătc ayx phunz muif huungđ huđ nyăngz dlayc setb taih yămz max hoopđ zuc yămz nyăngz tinc wax zanyf (toc stâub nyăngz munh oix zuc saz), laiv lanh yămz wa Yu-đê stâyz phangz oix zuc tiuv staox zoongz ninyh, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />năngx naih laiv lanh yămz wa pyau tuungx năngx gâyf nzac taih, yâuc năngx gâyf nzac pyau njaf lauf zoz nănh laiv huungđ tungh zăngc setb ninyh, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />laiv lanh yămz wa njăngx, năngx gâyf lauf wa pyau zoz nănh nyăngz guyz lub. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Six yămz wax đomc noib naih stinb nyăngz munh nzif cloon phunz sây hopb nu nyăngz munh nzif senz dlauc wâyb nzongf gôh! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Six, oix zuc cloo Zâu phunz nâyx đomc dlayc max setb taih toix tongz dlih. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Wâyc yămz wax đomc noib six naih zâuđ nanc đuungx ayx tuz tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh quef coonz zuyx guungh nib, zuyx muif huungđ taih tauv nâyx zanyf six max zeengx naih năngđ nâyx, tăng nây staox ninyh yâuc max naih. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Năngđ coong Zâu max tob wax đomc noib stoc nzac, six max naih mănv tuz njâuv. Six wâyc wax đomc tuz Zâu sên taih nyăngz munh, Nănh songđ tob wax đomc noib stoc nzac. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Wax zanyf, năngđ coong naih mănv coong ănz nyâuh: ‘Mangc geh, Zâu Jix-Tuz yămz nây! Max six yămz wa!’ yâuc năngx gâyf zen. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Wâyc naih za Jix-Tuz cloon za tâuc wac munh six setb taih, songđ ayx wax đomc njic hoouđ cloon jix caox njingc, năngđ coong hayh jaf tuz, six jaf njinh tuz sên nyăngz munh ninyh longđ. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Six nyâuh oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh! Mangc jađ, yaz bux muif huungđ dlayc phunz nyâuh quaix đangc nzuf nzof.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Six, tauv wax đomc zâuđ nanc nyăngz noib quaix,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">bah noib six nzămc jaz ninyh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">lav yâuc max siux gwăngz;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />wax đomc stingz tau six tăng guungh tuih nzac taih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">yămz wa guungh naih jab nyăngz tax huungđ six zuc đănz tongf nzuf.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Tauv wax zanyf, munh six phătc Bamh Munh naih jab yâuc naih tômx gwăngz eeng tăng wa vănx nzac taih. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Wax zanyf, Nănh six paiđ wax đomc stinz munh ninyh stâub dlonf Nănh sên taih nyăngz munh yămz nzêux pyâyz phangz, tăng nâyx phangz nib coonz ninyh tauv wax phangz guungh coonz.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Zef, oix zuc hoođ ah tiuh wac pây tăng bănx tauh njăngx. Wax zanyf njăngx quah setb tunb gunx yâuc goib noomh, nyâuh songđ pâyz tuz coong zunb dlih tauv stătx. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Lauf tinyh năngđ, nyâuh phătc wax đomc dlayc setb taih wax zanyf, Nyâuh six pâyz tuz coong Bamh Munh taih tauv stătx, yămz wa jeengh cah đangc. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh nâyx nzêuh munh six max quaix ninyh tuz tauv laiv zanyf wax đomc muif huungđ dlayc setb taih. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Guungh cloon nib six quaix ninyh nzuf, six yaz nâyx đomc wac stâyv quâyx six max quaix ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Six wax noib cloon wax săngx huđ, six max naih mănv pâyz tuz, hănđ wax đomc stinz munh yămz wa guungh lauf max pâyz, Toonz lauf max pâyz, cungb Pha cănh pâyz cuungv.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh! Oix zuc bôngh stimz yâuc cloo Zâu, wâyc nyâuh max pâyz tuz wax săngx huđ six laiv zanyf. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Cayx năngđ ah lanh munh setb jau ninyh gâyh pyau côz nâyx, gâyh nănh nyăngz pyau ninyh wax zanyf, songđ jaoz cumh pâuz phunz nănh nyăngz muif lanh cumh pâuz munh cun nănh nyăngz cumh pâuz, nănh songđ zăpx bux zu jeengh munh coong êu nănh oix zuc canyz nyâuđ; <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />wâyc nâyx, oix zuc bôngh stimz, wâyc nyâuh max pâyz pyau zâu laiv zanyf lauf tauv — bah nzămc, max six đamx munf; max six zayz ayx cayx max six toix bah đoomz tonx njâu — <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Cungb wangb max săngx bôngh bix pyau zâu lauf tauv wax zanyf, phătc nyâuh năngx jinh phâyx mâyc njoomh. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Six laiv huungđ yaz coong bux nyâuh, yaz lauf coong bux muif lanh nzuf: ‘Oix zuc bôngh stimz!’”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Wax zanyf, iz noib cah đangz timb six tauv Pyenv Mengc stêtz cloon Nzu Max Ănz Piny nyăngz stêtz, wax đomc stayb munh pyây cloon nzaox gâyf stênx steengb lov jau ayx laix, tauv nimx zoz tuz Zâu Yê-su, stiz nzăngđ hayh tayx Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Wâyc stiz coong: “Max hoopđ zuc zoz toix stêtz, wangb songx munh hayh lunc.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh yămz wa Bê-ta-ni njăngv, yămz săngh maoh pongz gumc wax tauh Si-môn nyăngz pyau Zâu Yê-su stâyv đah mâyf nhlinc năngv wax zanyf, naih ah lanh munh nzif, nzâyz ah nomz njăuz zâuz eengz ănz pong saix nzongf nyăngz na-đa yâuh taih. Bopc wax nomz eengz beengf, wax tauh munh nzif songđ taox yâuh ănz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz pyây. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Six yămz stiz nyăngz mungh tongx naih ah po munh numđ nhlenx nzongf: “Săngh laix bix taox lâyc đomc yâuh đangz ayx huđ nâyx? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Wâyc nâyx đomc yâuh đangz maic tuz năngx đuungx têx stamx pez noib congz nyanh nongc phunz munh zâuđ.” Stiz songđ mađ wax tauh munh nzif. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Six Zâu Yê-su coong: “Phanv dluyh nănh. Săngh laix nyâuh bix coong nănh? Nănh ayx ah huungđ cumh pâuz gongx phunz yaz. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Wâyc nyâuh muif dlih naih munh zâuđ cloon nyâuh yămz, toix laiv zanyf nyâuh oix nyâuh yâuc hayh ayx cumh pâuz gongx phunz stiz, six nyâuh max zâyf muif zanyf naih yaz. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Laiv huungđ nănh hayh ayx tuz nănh ayx nzof. Nănh hâuh yâuh ănz yaz nyăngz stayđ quaix đangc six bênc săngh tauv nzâyz ninyh plopx. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, yămz nây bamh canz tinyh phanv Cuđ Jenx tuz nzônh ninyh tauv laiv tix nâyx tauh munh nzif ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz yâuc tuz lănv wâyc săngx tauv nănh.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Năngx naih Yu-đa I-sa-ca-li-ôtx, six ah lanh wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây, ninyh pongh wax đomc stayb munh pyây nongc jaoz Zâu Yê-su phunz stiz. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Wax zanyf, numđ coong năngđ nâyx, stiz numđ nyađ nzongf songđ nyenc phunz nyanh nănh. Tăng wa nănh songđ lov săngx huđ congv nongc maic Zâu Yê-su.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Nzu Max Ănz Piny nyăngz stêtz tah yetx noib, munh tayx pax jiz yuungh jenz quaix Pyenv Mengc stêtz nyăngz noib, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây coong ănz Nănh: “Stayb pha oix nongc buz ninyh bênc yămz laiv tix phunz Mâyh nhlinc pyenv meengc stêtz?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Nănh songđ paiđ Nănh nyăngz iz lanh stayb sây ninyh, yâuc coong bux stiz: “Phanv nzac dlanyh cah njaf ninyh, naih ah lanh munh nzâyz eengz womz six pongh nyâuh. Phanv ninyh lêpc nănh. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Năngđ coong nănh nzac laiv sênz pyau, phanv coong ănz pyau Zâu coong: ‘Stayb pha naic coong: “Yaz cloon yaz nyăngz stayb sây yămz laiv bôngh nhlinc Pyenv Mengc stêtz loz?”’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Pyau zâu songđ nuz phunz nyâuh cah zâyc wax tab naih ah bôngh lub yămz wa bênc dloih nzuf, bix phanv bênc phunz pănh yămz wa gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Tăng wa stayb sây buz songđ nzac dlanyh ninyh, stiz phătc muif huungđ năngđ Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz nâyx, stiz songđ bênc Pyenv Mengc stêtz.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Tauv nzămc, Zâu Yê-su cloon wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây taih. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Stiz stâyv yămz wa đah mâyf nhlinc năngv wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh yămz nyâuh nâyx peob, jinh đangh cloon yaz yămz nây nhlinc năngv, naih ah lanh six maic yaz.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Stiz songđ numđ stauh nzongf, nâyx lanh tauv wax lanh naic Nănh coong: “Max zâyf yaz stah?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Six Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Nyâuh nây săpc nyâyc lanh nyăngz ah lanh, cloon yaz nokx nzu ănz zan wax tauh munh. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Wâyc Bamh Munh zuc zoz ninyh six năngđ tuz ja tauv Nănh nâyx, six tăng nănh bix Bamh Munh zuc maic, wax tauh senz zuc zâuđ gôh! Nănh wănh năngx gâyf steengb stâyv six năngx gongx têx.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Stiz năngx jinh nhlinc wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su songđ zoz nzu taih, sâuf hâuđ, watz goib, jaoz phunz stayb sây buz yâuc coong: “Oix zuc stipx. Nây six yaz nyăngz stinb a.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Nănh zef nzauf zan, sâuf hâuđ tuz, songđ jaoz phunz stayb sây buz, stiz songđ tinyh đoih hopb wax zan womz. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Nây six yaz njăpc nhlengc wac nyăngz samđ, nây samđ njâuc setb taih six wâyc phunz munh đuungx. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, tăng nây yaz six max hopb tungh cuđ pyâu nyăngz womz nzof zu tauv yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz wax noib, yaz nzăngđ hopb săngb tungh cuđ womz.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ayx ah baih nzungz tuz, stiz songđ huungv ninyh wa Ca-lan zoongz. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz coong: “Nyâuh muif lanh six tiuv quanyf yaz nzuf, năngđ naih ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Yaz bopc jămđ pax jiz yuungh nyăngz munh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">pax jiz yuungh six lunc nzuf.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Six tauv yaz tuz tăng tayc săngh taih, yaz six ninyh Ga-li-lê đangc nyâuh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Six Pi-tê tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Muif lanh hănđ tiuv quanyf mâyh, six yaz max đêh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Yaz coong senz bux mâyh, nâyx noib — nâyx munf — zayz coongh max zeengx ayx iz tonh cayx, mâyh six max nhlimc yaz pôz hâyđ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Six Pi-tê nzetx nhlengc găngz coong: “Yaz năngđ coong senz zuc cloon stayb pha tayc, yaz yâuc senz max quanyf mâyh.” Wax zanyf, wax đomc stayb sây buz lauf tinyh đoih coong ayx nâyx.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Tăng wa stiz songđ ninyh tauv ah cuib tinc, wax cuib tinc bux six hipđ ayx Gêt-sê-ma-ni, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz nănh wax đomc stayb sây: “Yaz cloo zâu nyăngz săngx huđ phanv stâyv nây bex.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Nănh ênz Pi-tê, Ya-coopc, cloon Yô-hanx lêpc Nănh ninyh, Nănh songđ numđ numđ stauh yâuc mungh huungđ nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Yaz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ jinh đangh numđ stauh nzongf, năngđ tayc nâyx. Phanv yămz nây bix bôngh stimz.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ninyh gâyh côz ah quăngc jau, Zâu Yê-su quâyc nzac nib ninyh yâuc cloo Zâu coong, năngđ coong tuz têx, joođ phunz wax săngx huđ ninyh blătc Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Nănh coong: “A-ba, Pha lex, muif huungđ dlayc Mâyh six hayh ayx tuz nzuf. Joođ zaub nâyx nomz zan gâyh yaz. Six max zâyf âyz yaz nyăngz âyx, six âyz Pha nyăngz âyx.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Nănh phunb đangz lauf yâuc phătc stiz mâyc njoomh, Nănh songđ êu Pi-tê: “Si-môn, mâyh mâyc njoomh naz? Mâyh max điub tuz ah săngx huđ haz? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Oix zuc canyz nyâuđ yâuc cloo Zâu, phunz nyâuh max zuc tuih nzac stâyv nyâuđ nyăngz jau. Stimz nyâuđ oix ayx âyz, six stinb a đoonh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Nănh zef setb ninyh cloo Zâu, ah hâyđ timb, coong wax đomc wac năngđ cah đangc nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Nănh zef phunb đangz lauf wa, phătc stiz mâyc njoomh nzuf, wâyc stiz mâyc yămb yămb, stiz yâuc max hayh tauz Nănh ayx laix. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Nănh phunb đangz lauf tah stamz hâyđ yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh lauf năngx jinh phâyx mâyc njoomh, hitb conv naz? Caux gôh! Săngx huđ tauv nzof. Phanv mangc geh! Bamh Munh cayx zuc jaoz phunz naih stoif munh nyăngz puf. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Nyoongz quef gôh. Mangc geh, maic yaz wax tauh taih tauv stătx nzof.” <verse eid="MRK 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Toongx Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh coong wac wax zanyf, Yu-đatc, ah lanh wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây, taih tauv, lêpc nănh taih six naih ah peob munh nzâyz nzuc đao cloon njăngx cănv, tăng wax đomc stayb munh pyây, wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb cloon wax đomc munh côx nyăngz tinc taih. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Wax zanyf, maic Zâu Yê-su wax tauh ayx phunz stiz ah cuyb njic hoouđ, coong: “Yaz tomz laiv lanh six wax tauh gôh. Phanv zoz nănh bix cayb ênz muf.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Taih tauv tinc wax zanyf, Yu-đatc songđ lênh dlih ninyh zac Zâu Yê-su wa, yâuc coong: “La-bi,” nănh songđ tomz Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Wax zanyf, nănh stiz songđ setb puf zoz Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Naih ah lanh munh six stâuđ wa cah sinh nyăngz munh, luutz nzuc đao setb taih, ninyh nyăuh tômx stayb munh nyăngz pâuz yâuc pătb nănh nyăngz bah noomh setc. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh taih nzâyz nzuc đao cloon njăngx cănv nongc zoz yaz cayx năngđ zoz ah lanh stac munh naz? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Muif noib yaz cloon nyâuh yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau nzaox gâyf, nyâuh yâuc max zoz yaz. Nây six wâyc phunz toix nzuf Canyx-stâub coong nyăngz wac.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Queengx Nănh ănz wa, stiz tinyh đoih tiuv nzuf. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Naih ah lanh munh gunx lêpc Nănh ninyh, cungb pâyb ah leepz đôc buyx nzêux stinb, stiz yâuc toopz zoz nănh, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />six nănh songđ quanyf wax leepz đôc buyx ănz wa, bix blănf stinb tiuv.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Nănh stiz yenv Zâu Yê-su ninyh stayb munh pyây nyăngz tinc, wax đomc stayb munh, wax đomc munh côx, cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb tinyh đoih taih căpx dlonf yămz wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Six Pi-tê lêpc Zâu Yê-su đangz ninyh gâyh côz côz, ninyh tauv stayb munh pyây nyăngz pyau cah đangc peengh, nănh songđ cloon wax đomc zu pyau peengz stâyv wa tâuf đauc sinh siz tâuf. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc stayb munh cloon njinh Yu-tai nyăngz ayx côx munh lov zanyx manyf munh cooux Zâu Yê-su nongc tayx Nănh, six stiz lov max tuz luungđ. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Wâyc naih munh đuungx ayx zanyx manyf cooux Nănh, six stiz nyăngz zanyx manyf wac yâuc max tinyh lăpb. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Naih ah phanx munh, stâuđ nyoongz quef ayx za zanyx manyf cooux Zâu Yê-su, coong <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Buz numđ Nănh coong ‘Yaz six zeb munh nongc puf ayx nâyx sênz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau, pôz noib cah njaf yaz six zâyv pitc sênz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau max zâyf nongc munh nyăngz puf ayx taih.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Hănđ nâyx, njinh nâyx cuyb dlayc, stiz nyăngz zanyx manyf wac lauf max tinyh toix. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Stayb munh pyây nyoongz quef yămz songx munh mungh tongx, songđ naic Zâu Yê-su coong: “Săngh laix mâyh max tauz luungđ tiny heh? Nâyx đomc munh ayx zanyx manyf cooux mâyh laiv huungđ?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Six Zâu Yê-su lauf max nyaoc tiny yâuc max tauz luungđ tiny. Stayb munh pyây zef naic Zâu Yê-su yâuc coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh zâyf Jix-Tuz, hoopđ zuc tanv wax Tauh nyăngz Toonz, max?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su coong: “Zâyf yaz gôh; nyâuh six tuz phătc</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:62">Bamh Munh stâyv Naih Qab Quaix Wax Tauh nyăngz byaoh phanx</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:62">yâuc tăng guungh wax đomc vănx nzac taih.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Tăng wa tômx stayb munh songđ zeb nănh nyăngz guyz yâuc coong: “Pănh laiv năngx nongc luungđ zanyx manyf nzof heh? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Nyâuh tuz numđ coong pamf nyăngz wac nzof. Nyâuh nyâyh ayx laix heh?” Tăng wa stiz songđ tinyh đoih tingc Nănh coong Nănh hoopđ zuc tayc. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Naih ah phanx munh songđ nzuv nzanh ănz Zâu Yê-su, pongz Nănh nyăngz mâyc yâuc bopc Nănh, songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Tâuc wac mungv geh!” Wax đomc peengz songđ toopz Nănh beb.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pi-tê yămz wa cah đi peengh njaf wax zanyf, stayb munh pyây wax đomc pâuz sab naih lanh taih nănh wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Phătc Pi-tê jinh đangh siz tâuf, mangc nănh yox, wax tauh pâuz sab coong: “Mâyh lauf cloon Yê-su, Na-sa-leetx nyăngz munh yămz.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Six nănh max nhlimc, yâuc coong: “Yaz max pâyz, lauf max pâyz mâyh coong luungđ.” Tăng wa nănh songđ quaix wa peengh cungh ngwaic ninyh. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Phătc Pi-tê wax tauh pâuz sab zef coong ănz stâuđ wa wax đomc munh coong: “Lâyc tauh munh six lauf stiz wax peob!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Six nănh lauf max nhlimc. Blătc wa ah zanyf têx, stâuđ wa wax đomc munh zef coong ănz Pi-tê: “Mâyh senz zâyf cloon wax peob munh, wâyc mâyh six lauf Ga-li-lê munh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Six nănh songđ zaux yâuc nyunc coong: “Yaz max pâyz wax tauh munh, six nâyx zanyf nyâuh coong tauv wax tauh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Toongx wax zanyf zayz coongh ayx nyâyc hâyđ caix, Pi-tê songđ săngx tauv Zâu Yê-su nyăngz wac bux nănh coong: “Zayz coongh max zeengx ayx iz tonh caix, mâyh six max nhlimc yaz pôz hâyđ,” nănh songđ numđ munz stimz bix haoh.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Toix bah đoomz tonx njâu, wax đomc stayb munh cloon wax đomc munh côx cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb cloon njinh ayx côx wax đomc Yu-tai munh sangv gwangh, stiz songđ stayb Zâu Yê-su, ênz Nănh ninyh jaoz phunz Phi-latx. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Phi-latx naic Nănh: “Mâyh six Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh zâyf max?” Six tauz Phi-latx wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su coong: “Mâyh cănh coong năngđ nâyx.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Wax đomc stayb munh pyây songđ cooux Nănh đuungx huungđ dlayc. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Wax zanyf, Phi-latx zef naic Nănh, coong: “Mâyh max tauz luungđ tiny haz? Phanv mangc, stiz jinh đangh cooux mâyh đuungx tuz nâyx!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Six Zâu Yê-su max tauz laiv zâux wac pâu tiny, ayx tuz Phi-latx numđ nyâyh ganc nzongf.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Tauv beengc stêtz, Phi-latx six pungx ah lanh stoif munh phunz songx munh âyz stiz joođ nyăngz. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Wax zanyf, naih ah lanh munh bux hipđ ayx Ba-la-batc jinh đangh zuc yămz nzauh cloon wax đomc sêu lunc nyăngz munh, yămz stiz sêu lunc wax zanyf stiz pamf stoif tayx munh. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Songx munh tinyh ênz taih tauv wax zanyf, songđ joođ êu Phi-latx ayx năngđ nănh yađ ayx phunz stiz nâyx. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Wax zanyf, Phi-latx naic stiz, coong: “Nyâuh oix yaz pungx Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh phunz nyâyh max?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Wâyc Phi-latx pâyz coong wax đomc stayb munh pyây jaoz Zâu Yê-su phunz nănh six wâyc numđ hănđ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Six wax đomc stayb munh lungz songx munh êu stiz joođ, Phi-latx zuc pungx Ba-la-batc phunz stiz. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Phi-latx zef naic stiz coong: “Ha nyâuh hipđ ayx Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh wax tauh yaz six cayx ayx laix ănz nănh heh?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Wax zanyf, songx munh zef hamv coong: “Phanv tingz nănh ănz săpc đăngc zax.” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Six, Phi-latx naic stiz coong: “Ha nâyx tauh munh Nănh ayx luungđ dlayc huđ heh?” Six, munh zef hamv năngx lub têx: “Phanv tingz nănh ănz săpc đăngc zax.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Wax zanyf, wâyc oix ayx hođ songx munh nyăngz nyâuđ, Phi-latx songđ pungx Ba-la-batc phunz stiz, bopc Zâu Yê-su tuz Phi-latx phunz peengz ênz Nănh ninyh nongc tingz jămz.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc peengz ênz Zâu Yê-su nzac wa peengh ninyh (six stămđ stoif tinc nyăngz peengh) yâuc êu peengz tinyh đoih taih dlonf wa, <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />stiz songđ pâyb ănz Nănh ah byenđ nhlêuf guyz, stiz yâuc nongc nzim saz ah nomz tany đongx ănz Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Stiz songđ yaf Nănh yâuc coong: “Paix Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh bex!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Tăng wa, stiz songđ nongc pya bopc Nănh nyăngz pyây, nzuv nzanh ănz Nănh, yâuc quâyc nzac paix Nănh. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Wax zanyf stiz pib jetx Nănh tuz, stiz songđ zay Nănh zuz wax byenđ nhlêuf guyz ayx queengx, yâuc zoz Nănh nyăngz guyz quav zuz phunz Nănh songđ ênz Nănh ninyh nongc tingz jămz ănz săpc đăngc zax. <verse eid="MRK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Naih ah lanh Sai-lin munh, bux hipđ ayx Si-môn six (A-lek-san-đê cloon Lu-phat nyăngz pha), tăng nănh nyăngz stâyz phangz taih, Pitb jau wax zanyf wax đomc peengz songđ phađ nănh đamz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz săpc đăngc zax.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Stiz ênz Zâu Yê-su ninyh tauv ah cuyb tinc hipđ ayx Gô-gô-ta (âyz gâyf six “Pyây mo tinc”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Stiz zoz ah huungđ mađ zanb tiu phunz Nănh hopb, six Nănh max hopb. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Stiz songđ zoz Nănh tingz jămz yâuc zoz Nănh nyăngz guyz taih tinyh phunz yâuc tinyh tâu nyupx tăm, mangc jađ laiv lanh tuz laiv phănc. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Stiz tingz jămz Zâu Yê-su wax zanyf six đuh săngx huđ. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Nây bangz six ja Nănh zuc tingc stoif nyăngz jau, coong: “Yu-tai Munh Nyăngz Huungh.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Stiz lauf tingz jămz iz lanh stac munh ănz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah sinh, ah lanh yămz byaoh phanx, ah lanh yămz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staix phanx. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />(Canyx stâub nyăngz wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf, coong: “Nănh zuc stunx năngđ stoif nyăngz munh.”) <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Pitb jau nyăngz munh pib Nănh, yâuc bănx stiz nyăngz pyây coong: “Ex! Lâyc tauh zeb bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau, pôz noib cah njaf zef zâyv tuz săngh, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />cănh njâuv mâyh, setb săpc đăngc zax taih geh!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Wax đomc stayb munh cloon wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb, lauf tinyh năngđ stiz tinyh đoih pib jetx Nănh, yâuc coong: “Nănh njâuv tuz munh đuungx, six nănh max cănh hayh njâuv tuz nănh. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />I-sa-la-ên nyăngz Huungh Jix-Tuz lex, nâyx zanyf phanv nzac săpc đăngc zac taih geh, phunz buz phătc buz nzăngđ zen.” Cloon Nănh zuc tingz jămz wa iz lanh lauf pib jetx Nănh.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Tăng săpc nyâyc săngx huđ, guungh nib nzămc tuz tauv pôz săngx huđ. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Tauv pôz săngx huđ, Zâu Yê-su hamv lub coong: “Ê-lô-i, Ê-lô-i, la-ma sa-bak-ta-ni?” Nâyx đomc wac âyz gâyf six: “Yaz nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh lex, yaz nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh, wâyc săngh laix Mâyh bix quanyf yaz heh?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Stâuđ stătx wa nyăngz munh numđ coong năngđ nâyx songđ coong: “Mangc geh, nănh êu Ê-li-ya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Tăng wa, naih ah lanh munh, tiuv ninyh zoz zeengb stotb yoomf ănz tiu stuib, tipb ănz lauđ tic queeng cah đany, wax tauh munh songđ yăngf phunz zâu Yê-su hopb, yâuc coong: “Phanv dluyh pyeenz nănh, mangc jađ Ê-li-ya taih ênz nănh nzac taih max.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su hamv ah stingb lub songđ siv setc. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau njaf wax leepz buyx zuc zeb ayx iz phanx tăng cah zâyc byaif tauv cah đi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Wax zanyf peengz pyây, nănh stâuđ yămz stătx Zâu Yê-su, phătc Zâu Yê-su nzuf siv năngđ nâyx, nănh songđ coong: “Tauh munh senz zâyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz gôh.” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Lauf naih ah đomc munh nzif stâuđ yămz côz mangc, wax đomc munh nzif naih Mak-đa-la nyăngz Ma-li-ya, (Ya-coopc jenz cloon Yô-sêtx nyăngz nzif) Ma-li-ya yâuc cloon Sa-lô-mê, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />wax đomc munh six tăng Nănh năngx jinh yămz wa Ga-li-lê, stiz ninyh lêpc Nănh yâuc bokc dlic Nănh, lauf naih đuungx lanh munh nzif timb lêpc Nănh ninyh tauv wa Yê-lu-sa-lem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Wax zanyf tauv cayx nzămc, wax noib six bênc cumh pâuz nyăngz noib, wâyc nyâyc noib six tingc congz noib, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />A-li-ma-tê stâyz phangz wax tauh Yô-sepx, nănh six ah lanh munh naih manyh tauh gongx yămz wax peob ayx côx munh, six lauf ah lanh munh jinh đangh zu Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz, ninyh tauv tinc wax zanyf, nănh jenb tam ninyh pongh Phi-latx joođ naic Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Wax zanyf, numđ coong Zâu Yê-su tayc nzof Phi-latx songđ numđ nyâyh ganc nzongf, songđ êu wax tauh peengz pyây taih, naic mangc jađ Zâu Yê-su tayc lauh max zeengx. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Tăng wax tauh peengz pyây Phi-latx pâyz tuz yox nzuf, songđ jaoz stayđ phunz Yô-sepx. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Maif ah funb đôc buyx, Yô-sepx songđ zoz Zâu Yê-su nzac săpc đăngc zax taih, yâuc nongc wax funb buyx sênh Nănh, songđ zaub Nănh ănz ah nomz stâu six stuc njăuz beengx ayx. Tăng wa Yô-sepx songđ cluiz ah nomz njăuz pyây taih zetx wa stâu jeengh. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Wax zanyf, Mak-đa-la nyăngz Ma-li-ya cloon Yô-sêtx nyăngz nzif Ma-li-ya tuz phătc zaub Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ nyăngz tinc.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Blătc tingc congz noib, Mak-đa-la nyăngz Ma-li-ya, Ya-coopc nyăngz nzif Ma-li-ya, cloon Sa-lô-mê, stiz maif yâuh đangz ninyh nongc ănz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Wax nomz gâyf paix nyăngz tah yetx noib, bah đoomz tonx njâu bah noib săngđ setb wax zanyf, stiz ninyh tauv wa stâu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Stiz lanh coong ănz lanh: “Mănv cayx nyongđ wax nomz njăuz pyây gâyh wa stâu jeengh phunz pănh heh?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Stiz mangc quaix ninyh, bâyf phătc wax nomz njăuz pyây stuyđ tăpx wa nzof, wax nomz njăuz pyây six lub nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Nzac wa stâu ninyh, stiz phătc ah lanh munh gunx zuz guyz pec stâyv yămz wa byaoh phanx, stiz songđ numđ cumh nzav nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Six wax tauh munh coong ănz stiz: “Năngx gâyf cumh nzav. Nyâuh lov Yê-su Na-sa-leetx nyăngz munh, six zuc tingz jămz yămz săpc đăngc zax wax Tauh. Nănh săngh taih nzof gôh! Nănh max yămz nây nzof. Phanv mangc munh zaub Nănh nyăngz stayđ nyăngz tinc. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Six, phanv muf, bux Nănh wax đomc stayb sây cloon Pi-tê coong: ‘Nănh ninyh tauv wa Ga-li-lê đangc nyâuh. Yămz wa nyâuh six tuz phătc Nănh’, cayx năngđ cah đangc Nănh bux nyâuh nâyx.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Wax đomc munh nzif coonx tiuv setb stâu cungh ngwaic taih, wâyc stiz numđ nyâyh ganc yâuc stinb sinx nzuf. Stiz max nzađ coong luungđ bux mănv six wâyc stiz cumh nzav nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />(Wax nomz gâyf paix nyăngz tah yetx noib bah đoomz tonx njâu, tauv săngh taih, Zâu Yê-su hinđ setb taih phunz Mak-đa-la nyăngz Ma-li-ya phătc đangc, nâyx lanh munh six Zâu Yê-su cah đangc luiđ nhlic tauh manđ setb nănh nyăngz stinb wax lanh. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Wax tauh munh nzif ninyh lănv bux phunz cah đangc lêpc Zâu Yê-su wax đomc munh, wax zanyf stiz jinh đangh haoh wâyc numđ stauh nzongf. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Six, stiz numđ Ma-li-ya coong nănh senz tuz phătc Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh săngh, six stiz lauf max zen.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Tăng wa, blătc wax đomc dlayc nzuf, Zâu Yê-su wănc pitc nomz jangx hinđ setb taih pongh wa iz lanh munh stiz six stayb sây buz wax peob jinh đangh yăngh jau muf stiz nyăngz stâyx phangz wax zanyf. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Six wa iz lanh munh, phunb đangz lauf, lănv bux wax đomc stayb sây, six stiz lauf max zen wa iz lanh munh.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Blătc wa, Zâu Yê-su hinđ setb taih phunz wa săpc byetx lanh stayb sây, wax zanyf stiz năngx jinh stâyv yămz wa đah mâyf nhlinc năngv, Nănh mađ stiz six wâyc stiz nyăngz nyâuđ nhlengc max zen phătc Nănh tăng tayc săngh taih wax đomc munh. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Nănh buz stiz coong: “Oix zuc ninyh nzêux guungh đi, nzônh Cuđ Jenx phunz muif lanh munh. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Laiv lanh zen yâuc ayx quaix-gâyf six tuz njâuv, năngx naih laiv lanh max zen six zuc tingc stoif. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Naih zen stimz nyăngz munh six tuz nâyx đomc jix caox njingc lêpc: Tim yaz nyăngz manyh, stiz six luiđ tuz manđ. Stiz yâuc hayh coong wax đomc săngb wac. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Stiz zoz nangz, max six hopb toix luungđ njaiz mađ njaiz six senz max hayh hoiđ stiz. Stiz tăpx puf ănz gumc munh, gumc munh six tuz gongx.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Zâu Yê-su coong bux stiz tuz, Nănh songđ tuz ênz staox guungh muf, stâyv yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz byaoh phanx. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Năngx naih wax đomc stayb sây stiz songđ setb ninyh nzônh gâyf nzêux muif đoif, Zâu lauf cloon stiz songc ayx cumh pâuz yâuc naih wax đomc jix caox njingc setb taih ayx zanyf manyf phunz Cuđ Jenx. A-meen.)<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>